window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":10,"en":"Urban Planning & Sustainable Architecture","zh":"都市規劃與永續建築","items":[{"w":"urban planner","pos":"n.","def":"a person who designs how a city grows and is used","cn":"都市規劃師","s":"The ________ suggested adding more parks near the old station, and the city council agreed because residents wanted more green areas.","zh":"那位都市規劃師建議在舊車站附近增設更多公園，而市議會同意了，因為居民想要更多綠地。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A1","t":"都市規劃師"},{"w":"town planning","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the work of deciding how land in a town is used","cn":"城鎮規劃","s":"Good ______ ______ can reduce traffic and noise, but poor decisions can leave a neighbourhood without schools or shops for many years.","zh":"良好的城鎮規劃可以減少交通與噪音，但錯誤的決策可能讓一個社區多年沒有學校或商店。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A2","t":"城鎮規劃"},{"w":"cityscape","pos":"n.","def":"the view of a city's buildings and streets","cn":"城市景觀","s":"From the top of the hill we could see the whole ________ of Taipei, and the lights looked beautiful after the sun went down.","zh":"從山頂上我們可以看到台北的整片城市景觀，而太陽下山後燈光看起來非常美麗。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A3","t":"城市景觀"},{"w":"skyline","pos":"n.","def":"the shape that tall buildings make against the sky","cn":"天際線","s":"Taipei 101 still stands out on the city's ________, although several new towers have been built around it in recent years.","zh":"台北101在這座城市的天際線上依然很突出，儘管近年來它周圍已經蓋了好幾棟新大樓。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A4","t":"天際線"},{"w":"downtown","pos":"n.","def":"the main business area in the centre of a city","cn":"市中心；商業區","s":"Many offices are located in the ________ area, so the streets are crowded on weekdays but quiet on Sunday mornings.","zh":"許多辦公室都位於市中心地區，所以街道在平日很擁擠，但在星期天早上卻很安靜。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A5","t":"市中心"},{"w":"outskirts","pos":"n.","def":"the outer areas of a town or city","cn":"郊區；市郊","s":"My uncle lives on the ________ of the city, so the rent is cheaper, but he has to drive for an hour to get to work.","zh":"我叔叔住在城市的郊區，所以房租比較便宜，但他得開一小時的車去上班。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A6","t":"郊區"},{"w":"suburb","pos":"n.","def":"a living area at the edge of a large city","cn":"郊區住宅區","s":"After their second child was born, the couple moved to a quiet ________ because they wanted a garden and a bigger home.","zh":"第二個孩子出生後，這對夫妻搬到一個安靜的郊區住宅區，因為他們想要有花園和更大的房子。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A7","t":"郊區住宅區"},{"w":"neighbourhood","pos":"n.","def":"an area of a town and the people who live there","cn":"社區；街坊","s":"Our ________ has a small park, a bakery and a night market, so we rarely need to drive anywhere at the weekend.","zh":"我們的社區有一座小公園、一家麵包店和一個夜市，所以週末我們很少需要開車去任何地方。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A8","t":"社區"},{"w":"district","pos":"n.","def":"an official area of a city","cn":"區；行政區","s":"Xinyi ________ is famous for its shopping malls and offices, while Wanhua is known for its temples and old streets.","zh":"信義區以購物中心和辦公大樓聞名，而萬華則以廟宇和老街著稱。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A9","t":"區"},{"w":"land use","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the way an area of land is used, such as for homes or farms","cn":"土地利用","s":"The government studied ______ ______ in the region carefully, because farmers and builders both wanted the same flat area near the river.","zh":"政府仔細研究了該地區的土地利用，因為農民和建商都想要河邊同一塊平坦的土地。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A10","t":"土地利用"},{"w":"master plan","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a detailed long-term plan for developing an area","cn":"整體規劃；總體計畫","s":"The city published a ten-year ______ ______ for the harbour area, and it includes new homes, a museum and a long cycling path.","zh":"市政府公布了港區的十年整體規劃，而其中包括新住宅、一座博物館和一條很長的自行車道。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A11","t":"整體規劃"},{"w":"urban sprawl","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the uncontrolled spread of a city into the countryside","cn":"都市擴張；城市蔓延","s":"______ ______ has covered many farms with houses and car parks, so people now have to drive further to reach the countryside.","zh":"都市擴張已經讓許多農田被房屋和停車場覆蓋，因此人們現在得開更遠的車才能到鄉間。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A12","t":"都市擴張"},{"w":"greenbelt","pos":"n.","def":"a protected area of fields and woods around a city","cn":"綠帶（城市周圍的保護綠地）","s":"Builders are not allowed to put houses on the ________ around the city, so the farmland and forests there are still protected.","zh":"建商不被允許在城市周圍的綠帶上蓋房子，所以那裡的農田和森林仍受到保護。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A13","t":"綠帶"},{"w":"brownfield site","pos":"n.phr.","def":"land that was used for industry and can be built on again","cn":"棕地（舊工業用地）","s":"The old sugar factory became a ______ ______ after it closed, and now the city wants to turn it into an arts centre.","zh":"那座舊糖廠關閉後成為一塊棕地，而現在市政府想把它改造成藝術中心。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A14","t":"棕地"},{"w":"greenfield site","pos":"n.phr.","def":"land that has never been built on before","cn":"綠地（未開發用地）","s":"Building on a ______ ______ is often cheaper, but environmental groups say it destroys farmland and wildlife habitats.","zh":"在未開發的綠地上興建通常比較便宜，但環保團體表示這會破壞農地和野生動物的棲地。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A15","t":"未開發的綠地"},{"w":"redevelopment","pos":"n.","def":"the process of rebuilding an old area with new buildings","cn":"重建；再開發","s":"The ________ of the old harbour brought new cafés and apartments, but some long-time residents could no longer afford to live there.","zh":"舊港口的重建帶來了新的咖啡店和公寓，但一些長期居民再也負擔不起住在那裡的費用。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A16","t":"重建"},{"w":"urban renewal","pos":"n.phr.","def":"improving old parts of a city by repairing or rebuilding them","cn":"都市更新","s":"Many old apartment buildings in Taipei need ______ ______, but owners often argue for years before they agree on a plan.","zh":"台北許多老舊公寓需要都市更新，但屋主們往往要爭論好幾年才會對計畫達成共識。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A17","t":"都市更新"},{"w":"gentrification","pos":"n.","def":"when richer people move into a poor area and prices rise","cn":"仕紳化；中產階級化","s":"________ has made the old street more stylish with new coffee shops, yet many local families have been forced to move away.","zh":"仕紳化讓這條老街因新咖啡店而變得更時髦，然而許多當地家庭卻被迫搬離。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A18","t":"仕紳化"},{"w":"new town","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a town planned and built all at once","cn":"新市鎮","s":"Linkou was developed as a ______ ______ for people working in Taipei, and it now has its own shopping malls and hospitals.","zh":"林口被開發成一個為在台北工作的人規劃的新市鎮，而現在它擁有自己的購物中心和醫院。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A19","t":"新市鎮"},{"w":"planning permission","pos":"n.phr.","def":"official approval needed before you build something","cn":"建築許可；規劃許可","s":"The family wanted to add a third floor to their house, but they had to wait six months for ______ ______ from the council.","zh":"那家人想在房子上加蓋第三層樓，但他們必須等六個月才拿到市議會的建築許可。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A20","t":"建築許可"},{"w":"city council","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the group of elected people who run a city","cn":"市議會","s":"The ______ ______ voted to close the road to cars on Sundays, and most shop owners were happy because more walkers came by.","zh":"市議會投票決定週日禁止汽車進入這條道路，而大多數店家都很高興，因為有更多行人經過。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A21","t":"市議會"},{"w":"mayor","pos":"n.","def":"the elected leader of a city or town","cn":"市長","s":"The ________ promised to build three new libraries before the next election, but some citizens doubted there was enough money.","zh":"市長承諾在下次選舉前興建三座新圖書館，但有些市民懷疑經費是否足夠。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A22","t":"市長"},{"w":"town hall","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the building where a town's local government works","cn":"市政廳；鎮公所","s":"Residents gathered outside the ______ ______ to protest against the new highway, and the meeting lasted until late at night.","zh":"居民們聚集在市政廳外抗議新的高速公路，而那場會議一直持續到深夜。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A23","t":"市政廳"},{"w":"layout","pos":"n.","def":"the way the parts of a place are arranged","cn":"佈局；配置","s":"The ________ of the old town is confusing, because the narrow streets twist and turn, so tourists often get lost.","zh":"這座古城的佈局很令人困惑，因為狹窄的街道彎來彎去，所以觀光客常常迷路。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A24","t":"佈局"},{"w":"plaza","pos":"n.","def":"an open public square in a city","cn":"廣場","s":"On summer evenings, families fill the ________ in front of the station, and children play while street musicians perform.","zh":"在夏天的傍晚，家庭們擠滿了車站前的廣場，孩子們在玩耍，而街頭音樂家在表演。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A25","t":"廣場"},{"w":"public space","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an area such as a park or square that everyone can use","cn":"公共空間","s":"Good ______ ______ helps people meet their neighbours, so planners now design more benches, parks and wide pavements.","zh":"良好的公共空間能幫助人們認識鄰居，因此規劃者現在設計了更多長椅、公園和寬人行道。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A26","t":"公共空間"},{"w":"pedestrianise","pos":"v.","def":"to close a street to cars so only people can walk there","cn":"將（街道）改為行人徒步區","s":"The city decided to ________ the busy shopping street, and although drivers complained, the shops soon had more customers.","zh":"市政府決定把那條繁忙的購物街改為行人徒步區，雖然駕駛人抱怨，但商店很快就有了更多顧客。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A27","t":"改為行人徒步區"},{"w":"cul-de-sac","pos":"n.","def":"a short street that is closed at one end","cn":"死巷；死胡同","s":"We live at the end of a quiet ________, so there is very little traffic and the children can ride their bikes safely.","zh":"我們住在一條安靜死巷的盡頭，所以車流非常少，孩子們可以安全地騎腳踏車。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A28","t":"死巷"},{"w":"high street","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the main shopping street in a town","cn":"主要商店街；大街","s":"Many small shops on the ______ ______ have closed because people now shop online, but the cafés are still busy.","zh":"主要商店街上許多小店已經關門，因為人們現在都在網路上購物，但咖啡店仍然生意興隆。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A29","t":"主要商店街"},{"w":"waterfront","pos":"n.","def":"the part of a city next to a river, lake or sea","cn":"濱水區；水岸","s":"The ________ in Tamsui is crowded at sunset, because people love to walk by the river and eat snacks from the stalls.","zh":"淡水的水岸在日落時分很擁擠，因為人們喜歡沿著河邊散步並吃攤販的小吃。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A30","t":"水岸"},{"w":"inner city","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the older, central part of a city, often with social problems","cn":"舊市區；內城區","s":"Some ______ ______ areas have old buildings and few jobs, so the government is offering money to help small businesses open there.","zh":"一些舊市區地區建築老舊且工作機會稀少，所以政府提供資金幫助小型企業在那裡開業。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A31","t":"舊市區"},{"w":"mixed-use","pos":"adj.","def":"used for both homes and businesses","cn":"混合使用的；住商混合的","s":"The new ________ building has shops on the ground floor and flats above, so residents can buy groceries without leaving home.","zh":"這棟新的住商混合大樓一樓是商店、樓上是公寓，所以居民不用出門就能買到日用品。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A32","t":"住商混合"},{"w":"megacity","pos":"n.","def":"a very large city with over ten million people","cn":"超大城市","s":"Tokyo is a ________ with more than thirty million people in its wider area, yet its trains are famous for being clean and on time.","zh":"東京是一座大都會區人口超過三千萬的超大城市，然而它的火車以乾淨準時聞名。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A33","t":"超大城市"},{"w":"conurbation","pos":"n.","def":"a large area where several towns have grown together","cn":"大都會區；集合城市","s":"Taipei and New Taipei form one huge ________, so many people live in one city but work in the other every day.","zh":"台北和新北形成了一個巨大的大都會區，所以許多人住在一個城市，但每天在另一個城市工作。","part":"A","sec":"City Planning & Land Use 城市規劃與土地利用","lab":"A34","t":"大都會區"},{"w":"architect","pos":"n.","def":"a person whose job is to design buildings","cn":"建築師","s":"The ________ designed the library with large windows, so readers can enjoy natural sunlight while they study.","zh":"那位建築師把圖書館設計成有大窗戶，所以讀者在讀書時可以享受自然陽光。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A35","t":"建築師"},{"w":"architecture","pos":"n.","def":"the style and design of buildings","cn":"建築；建築風格","s":"Tainan is full of old temples and Japanese-era houses, so visitors who love ________ can spend days exploring the city.","zh":"台南到處都是古老廟宇和日治時期的房子，所以喜愛建築的遊客可以花好幾天探索這座城市。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A36","t":"建築"},{"w":"skyscraper","pos":"n.","def":"a very tall modern building in a city","cn":"摩天大樓","s":"The new ________ has more than eighty floors, and people on the top floor can see the ocean on a clear day.","zh":"這棟新的摩天大樓有八十多層樓，而在頂樓的人天氣晴朗時可以看到海洋。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A37","t":"摩天大樓"},{"w":"high-rise","pos":"adj.","def":"very tall, with many floors","cn":"高樓層的；高樓的","s":"Many families in Hong Kong live in ________ apartments, so children often take the lift instead of playing in a garden.","zh":"許多香港家庭住在高樓公寓裡，所以孩子們常常搭電梯，而不是在花園裡玩耍。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A38","t":"高樓"},{"w":"tower block","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a tall building with many flats or offices","cn":"高層公寓大樓","s":"The old ______ ______ was badly built in the 1970s, so the council decided to knock it down and build safer homes.","zh":"那棟高層公寓大樓在1970年代蓋得很差，所以市議會決定拆掉它並興建更安全的住宅。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A39","t":"高層公寓大樓"},{"w":"facade","pos":"n.","def":"the front outside wall of a building","cn":"（建築物的）正面；外牆","s":"The museum kept the old brick ________ of the bank, but the inside was completely rebuilt with glass and steel.","zh":"這座博物館保留了那間銀行的舊紅磚正面外牆，但內部完全用玻璃和鋼材重建。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A40","t":"正面外牆"},{"w":"storey","pos":"n.","def":"one level or floor of a building","cn":"（樓房的）層","s":"Our school's classroom building has five ________, and the science labs are on the top floor because of the good light.","zh":"我們學校的教學大樓有五層樓，而自然實驗室位於頂樓，因為那裡光線良好。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A41","t":"層樓"},{"w":"floor plan","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a drawing that shows the rooms of a building from above","cn":"平面圖；格局圖","s":"Before we rented the flat, we studied the ______ ______ carefully, because we wanted each child to have a separate bedroom.","zh":"在租這間公寓之前，我們仔細研究了平面圖，因為我們希望每個孩子都有獨立的臥室。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A42","t":"平面圖"},{"w":"atrium","pos":"n.","def":"a large open space inside a building, often with a glass roof","cn":"中庭；天井大廳","s":"The hotel has a huge ________ full of plants, and guests can see the sky through its glass roof while they eat breakfast.","zh":"這家飯店有一個種滿植物的巨大中庭，而客人吃早餐時可以透過玻璃屋頂看到天空。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A43","t":"中庭"},{"w":"balcony","pos":"n.","def":"a small platform outside an upper window of a building","cn":"陽台","s":"My grandmother grows herbs and flowers on her ________, and she sits there every morning to drink her tea.","zh":"我奶奶在她的陽台上種香草和花，而且她每天早上都坐在那裡喝茶。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A44","t":"陽台"},{"w":"courtyard","pos":"n.","def":"an open space surrounded by walls or buildings","cn":"庭院；中庭","s":"The traditional house is built around a quiet ________, so the family can enjoy fresh air while staying private.","zh":"這棟傳統房屋圍繞著一個安靜的庭院而建，所以這家人既能享受新鮮空氣又能保有隱私。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A45","t":"庭院"},{"w":"terrace","pos":"n.","def":"a flat outdoor area next to a building or on a roof","cn":"露台；平台","s":"We ate dinner on the restaurant's ________, and we could watch the boats on the river while the sun went down.","zh":"我們在餐廳的露台上吃晚餐，而且在太陽下山時可以看著河上的船隻。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A46","t":"露台"},{"w":"rooftop","pos":"n.","def":"the outside top surface of a building","cn":"屋頂","s":"Several schools in Taipei have turned their ________ into vegetable gardens, and students learn to grow food there.","zh":"台北有幾所學校已經把它們的屋頂改造成菜園，而學生們在那裡學習種植食物。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A47","t":"屋頂"},{"w":"basement","pos":"n.","def":"the part of a building below the ground","cn":"地下室","s":"The heavy rain flooded the ________ of our building, so all the cars in the car park had to be moved.","zh":"豪雨淹沒了我們大樓的地下室，所以停車場裡所有的車都必須移走。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A48","t":"地下室"},{"w":"entrance hall","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the first room or space you enter in a building","cn":"門廳；入口大廳","s":"Visitors wait in the bright ______ ______ while the receptionist checks their names, and they can read about the company's history there.","zh":"訪客在明亮的入口大廳等候，同時接待員核對他們的名字，而他們可以在那裡閱讀公司的歷史。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A49","t":"入口大廳"},{"w":"staircase","pos":"n.","def":"a set of stairs inside a building","cn":"樓梯","s":"The old wooden ________ makes a loud noise when people walk on it, so everyone can hear when someone comes home late.","zh":"那座老舊的木製樓梯在人們走上去時會發出很大的聲響，所以有人晚歸時大家都聽得到。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A50","t":"樓梯"},{"w":"ceiling","pos":"n.","def":"the inside surface at the top of a room","cn":"天花板","s":"The café has a very high ________ with wooden fans, so it feels cool and spacious even in the summer.","zh":"那家咖啡店有很高的天花板和木製吊扇，所以即使在夏天也感覺涼爽又寬敞。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A51","t":"天花板"},{"w":"beam","pos":"n.","def":"a long thick piece of wood or metal that supports a roof","cn":"樑；橫樑","s":"The workers found a crack in the main wooden ________, so they closed the old temple until it could be repaired.","zh":"工人們發現主要的木頭橫樑上有一道裂縫，所以他們關閉了這座老廟直到可以修好為止。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A52","t":"橫樑"},{"w":"partition wall","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a thin wall that divides a room into smaller spaces","cn":"隔間牆","s":"The landlord added a ______ ______ to turn the big room into two bedrooms, but now we can hear everything our roommate says.","zh":"房東加了一道隔間牆把大房間變成兩間臥室，但現在我們聽得到室友說的每一句話。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A53","t":"隔間牆"},{"w":"cantilever","pos":"n.","def":"a long beam fixed at only one end that sticks out","cn":"懸臂；懸臂樑","s":"The famous balcony is supported by a steel ________, so it seems to float in the air above the valley.","zh":"那座著名的陽台由一根鋼製懸臂樑支撐，所以它看起來像是飄浮在山谷上方的空中。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A54","t":"懸臂樑"},{"w":"spire","pos":"n.","def":"a tall pointed structure on top of a church or tower","cn":"尖塔；尖頂","s":"You can see the church's white ________ from far away, and travellers once used it to find their way to the village.","zh":"你從很遠的地方就能看到教堂的白色尖塔，而以前旅人曾用它來找到前往村莊的路。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A55","t":"尖塔"},{"w":"listed building","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an old building that is protected by law","cn":"受保護的歷史建築","s":"The cinema is a ______ ______, so the owner cannot knock it down, although he is allowed to repair the inside.","zh":"那間電影院是一棟受法律保護的歷史建築，所以業主不能拆除它，雖然他被允許修繕內部。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A56","t":"受法律保護的歷史建築"},{"w":"skylight","pos":"n.","def":"a window in a roof that lets in light","cn":"天窗","s":"We put a ________ in the bathroom roof, so now we do not need to turn on the lights during the day.","zh":"我們在浴室屋頂裝了一扇天窗，所以現在白天不需要開燈了。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A57","t":"天窗"},{"w":"open-plan","pos":"adj.","def":"having few inside walls, with one large shared space","cn":"開放式（格局）的","s":"Our company moved to an ________ office, and although it is easier to talk to colleagues, it is also much noisier.","zh":"我們公司搬到開放式辦公室，雖然和同事交談更方便，但也吵鬧得多。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A58","t":"開放式"},{"w":"minimalist","pos":"adj.","def":"using very few things or simple decoration","cn":"極簡風格的","s":"Their ________ flat has white walls and very little furniture, so it looks clean but sometimes feels a little cold.","zh":"他們的極簡風格公寓有白色牆壁和很少的家具，所以看起來很乾淨，但有時感覺有點冷清。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A59","t":"極簡風格"},{"w":"modernist","pos":"adj.","def":"in the plain 20th-century style using concrete, steel and glass","cn":"現代主義的","s":"The university's ________ library was built in 1965, and its simple shapes and huge windows still look fresh today.","zh":"這所大學的現代主義圖書館建於1965年，而它簡單的造型和巨大的窗戶至今看起來仍很新穎。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A60","t":"現代主義"},{"w":"symmetry","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of having two halves that match exactly","cn":"對稱","s":"The temple was designed with perfect ________, so the left side of the building looks exactly like the right side.","zh":"這座廟宇被設計成完美的對稱，所以建築物的左側看起來和右側一模一樣。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A61","t":"對稱"},{"w":"interior","pos":"n.","def":"the inside of a building or room","cn":"內部；室內","s":"The outside of the old house looks plain, but the ________ is full of beautiful wooden furniture and colourful tiles.","zh":"這棟老房子的外觀看起來很樸素，但它的內部卻滿是漂亮的木製家具和色彩繽紛的磁磚。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A62","t":"內部"},{"w":"exterior","pos":"n.","def":"the outside of a building","cn":"外部；外觀","s":"The workers are painting the ________ of the school light blue, and they will finish before the new term begins.","zh":"工人們正在把學校的外觀漆成淡藍色，而他們會在新學期開始前完成。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A63","t":"外觀"},{"w":"renovate","pos":"v.","def":"to repair and improve an old building","cn":"翻修；整修","s":"My parents decided to ________ the old kitchen, so we ate takeaway food every night for almost a month.","zh":"我爸媽決定翻修舊廚房，所以我們有將近一個月每晚都吃外帶食物。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A64","t":"翻修"},{"w":"demolish","pos":"v.","def":"to knock down a building completely","cn":"拆除","s":"The city plans to ________ the old market next year, but many shoppers have signed a petition to save it.","zh":"市政府計畫明年拆除舊市場，但許多購物者已經連署請願要保留它。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A65","t":"拆除"},{"w":"scale model","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small copy of a building with the same proportions","cn":"比例模型","s":"The architects showed a ______ ______ of the new stadium, and the children loved looking at the tiny seats and trees.","zh":"建築師們展示了新體育館的比例模型，而孩子們很喜歡看那些小小的座位和樹木。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A66","t":"比例模型"},{"w":"loft","pos":"n.","def":"a room or flat in the top part of a building","cn":"閣樓；（工廠改建的）挑高公寓","s":"The artist turned an old warehouse ________ into a studio, because the high ceiling and big windows gave her plenty of light.","zh":"那位藝術家把一間舊倉庫閣樓改造成工作室，因為挑高的天花板和大窗戶給了她充足的光線。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A67","t":"閣樓"},{"w":"curtain wall","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an outer wall of glass that does not hold up the building","cn":"帷幕牆","s":"The office tower is covered with a glass ______ ______, so it looks bright, but it can become very hot in summer.","zh":"那棟辦公大樓覆蓋著玻璃帷幕牆，所以看起來很明亮，但在夏天可能會變得非常熱。","part":"A","sec":"Buildings & Architectural Design 建築物與建築設計","lab":"A68","t":"帷幕牆"},{"w":"cement","pos":"n.","def":"a grey powder mixed with water and sand to make concrete","cn":"水泥","s":"Making ________ releases a lot of carbon dioxide, so engineers are testing new materials that are kinder to the planet.","zh":"製造水泥會釋放大量二氧化碳，所以工程師們正在測試對地球更友善的新材料。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A69","t":"水泥"},{"w":"reinforced concrete","pos":"n.phr.","def":"concrete made stronger with steel bars inside it","cn":"鋼筋混凝土","s":"Most apartment buildings in Taiwan are made of ______ ______, because it can survive both typhoons and strong earthquakes.","zh":"台灣大多數公寓大樓是用鋼筋混凝土建造的，因為它能抵擋颱風和強烈地震。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A70","t":"鋼筋混凝土"},{"w":"timber","pos":"n.","def":"wood used for building","cn":"木材","s":"The cabin is built entirely from local ________, so it blends into the forest and smells of fresh pine.","zh":"這間小屋完全用當地的木材建造，所以它與森林融為一體，而且散發著新鮮松木的香氣。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A71","t":"木材"},{"w":"cross-laminated timber","pos":"n.phr.","def":"strong panels made by gluing layers of wood crosswise","cn":"交錯層壓木材（CLT）","s":"The new school was built with ______ ______, which is strong enough for tall buildings but stores carbon instead of releasing it.","zh":"這所新學校是用交錯層壓木材建造的，它堅固到足以蓋高樓，而且會儲存碳而不是釋放碳。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A72","t":"交錯層壓木材"},{"w":"bamboo","pos":"n.","def":"a fast-growing tall plant with hard hollow stems","cn":"竹子","s":"Builders in many Asian countries use ________ for scaffolds and walls, because it grows quickly and is surprisingly strong.","zh":"許多亞洲國家的建築工人用竹子搭鷹架和建牆，因為它長得快而且出奇地堅固。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A73","t":"竹子"},{"w":"rammed earth","pos":"n.phr.","def":"soil pressed hard into walls as a building material","cn":"夯土","s":"The walls of the visitor centre are made of ______ ______, so the rooms stay cool in summer and warm in winter.","zh":"遊客中心的牆是用夯土做成的，所以房間在夏天保持涼爽，在冬天保持溫暖。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A74","t":"夯土"},{"w":"plywood","pos":"n.","def":"thin layers of wood glued together into a board","cn":"合板；夾板","s":"Before the typhoon arrived, shop owners covered their windows with ________, and they took the boards down two days later.","zh":"颱風來襲前，店家用合板蓋住窗戶，而他們兩天後才把木板拆下來。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A75","t":"合板"},{"w":"glass","pos":"n.","def":"a hard clear material used for windows","cn":"玻璃","s":"The museum's walls are made almost entirely of ________, so visitors can look out at the mountains while they view the art.","zh":"這座博物館的牆幾乎完全用玻璃做成，所以遊客在欣賞藝術時可以眺望群山。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A76","t":"玻璃"},{"w":"asphalt","pos":"n.","def":"a black sticky material used to cover roads","cn":"柏油；瀝青","s":"Dark ________ absorbs a lot of heat on sunny days, so the city is testing lighter road surfaces to keep streets cooler.","zh":"深色柏油在晴天會吸收大量熱能，所以市政府正在測試顏色較淺的路面以保持街道涼爽。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A77","t":"柏油"},{"w":"gravel","pos":"n.","def":"small stones used to make paths and roads","cn":"碎石；礫石","s":"The park paths are covered with ________ instead of concrete, so rainwater can soak into the ground and the trees stay healthy.","zh":"公園的小徑鋪的是碎石而不是混凝土，所以雨水能滲入地面，樹木也能保持健康。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A78","t":"碎石"},{"w":"tile","pos":"n.","def":"a thin flat square piece used to cover floors, walls or roofs","cn":"磁磚；瓦片","s":"Many old houses in Taiwan have colourful ________ on their walls, and collectors now pay a lot of money for them.","zh":"台灣許多老房子的牆上有色彩繽紛的磁磚，而收藏家現在願意花大錢購買它們。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A79","t":"磁磚"},{"w":"plaster","pos":"n.","def":"a paste that becomes hard and smooth when it dries on walls","cn":"灰泥；石膏","s":"The ________ on the old walls was cracking, so the workers removed it and covered the bricks with a fresh layer.","zh":"舊牆上的灰泥正在龜裂，所以工人們把它刮掉，並在磚塊上塗了一層新的。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A80","t":"灰泥"},{"w":"cladding","pos":"n.","def":"a covering added to the outside walls of a building","cn":"（建築）外牆覆層","s":"After a terrible fire, the government banned some kinds of plastic ________, because it allowed flames to spread up the building.","zh":"在一場可怕的火災之後，政府禁止了某些塑膠外牆覆層，因為它會讓火焰沿著大樓往上蔓延。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A81","t":"外牆覆層"},{"w":"hempcrete","pos":"n.","def":"a light building material made from hemp plants and lime","cn":"大麻混凝土（麻纖維石灰建材）","s":"________ is lighter than concrete and keeps homes warm, but it is not strong enough to hold up a tall building alone.","zh":"大麻混凝土比混凝土輕而且能讓房屋保暖，但它的強度不足以單獨支撐高樓。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A82","t":"大麻混凝土"},{"w":"building site","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a place where a building is being built","cn":"建築工地","s":"Children are not allowed to play near the ______ ______, because heavy machines are moving around and things may fall from above.","zh":"孩子們不准在建築工地附近玩耍，因為重型機具在四處移動，而且可能有東西從上方掉落。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A83","t":"建築工地"},{"w":"contractor","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company paid to do building work","cn":"承包商","s":"We hired a ________ to fix our roof, but he left after two days, so the rain still comes in when there is a storm.","zh":"我們僱了一位承包商來修屋頂，但他兩天後就走了，所以暴風雨時雨水還是會漏進來。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A84","t":"承包商"},{"w":"bricklayer","pos":"n.","def":"a worker who builds walls with bricks","cn":"砌磚工人","s":"The ________ worked carefully in the hot sun, and by evening he had finished the whole garden wall.","zh":"那位砌磚工人在炎熱的陽光下仔細工作，而到了傍晚他已經完成了整道花園圍牆。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A85","t":"砌磚工人"},{"w":"carpenter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who makes and repairs wooden things","cn":"木匠","s":"My grandfather was a ________ for forty years, and he built most of the tables and chairs in our house.","zh":"我爺爺當了四十年的木匠，而我們家大部分的桌椅都是他做的。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A86","t":"木匠"},{"w":"plumber","pos":"n.","def":"a person who fixes water pipes and toilets","cn":"水管工人","s":"Water was leaking from the kitchen pipe all night, so we called a ________ early in the morning to repair it.","zh":"廚房的水管漏了一整晚的水，所以我們一大早就打電話請水管工人來修理。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A87","t":"水管工人"},{"w":"electrician","pos":"n.","def":"a person who puts in and repairs electrical wires","cn":"電工","s":"The lights kept turning off by themselves, so my father asked an ________ to check the wiring in the old flat.","zh":"燈一直自己熄滅，所以我爸爸請了一位電工來檢查這間老公寓的線路。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A88","t":"電工"},{"w":"bulldozer","pos":"n.","def":"a powerful machine that pushes earth and knocks down buildings","cn":"推土機","s":"A huge ________ knocked down the old factory walls in just one morning, and trucks carried the rubble away in the afternoon.","zh":"一台巨大的推土機只花一個早上就推倒了舊工廠的牆，而卡車在下午把瓦礫載走。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A89","t":"推土機"},{"w":"load-bearing","pos":"adj.","def":"supporting the weight of the building above it","cn":"承重的","s":"You cannot remove a ________ wall without adding a steel beam, because the floors above might fall down.","zh":"你不能在沒有加裝鋼樑的情況下拆除承重牆，因為上面的樓層可能會倒塌。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A90","t":"承重"},{"w":"prefabricated","pos":"adj.","def":"made in parts in a factory and put together on site","cn":"預製的；組合式的","s":"The ________ homes were built in a factory in a few weeks, so families who lost their houses in the flood could move in quickly.","zh":"這些預製房屋在工廠裡幾週內就建好了，所以在水災中失去家園的家庭能很快搬進去。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A91","t":"預製"},{"w":"3D-printed","pos":"adj.","def":"made layer by layer by a machine that prints materials","cn":"3D列印的","s":"The company built a small ________ house in just two days, and it cost much less than a normal home.","zh":"那家公司只花兩天就蓋好一棟小型3D列印房屋，而且它的成本比一般住宅低得多。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A92","t":"3D列印"},{"w":"earthquake-proof","pos":"adj.","def":"built so that it will not fall down in an earthquake","cn":"防震的；耐震的","s":"Taiwan has many ________ buildings, but older homes still need checks because they were built before the safety rules changed.","zh":"台灣有許多耐震建築，但較老的房屋仍需要檢查，因為它們是在安全規定修改之前建造的。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A93","t":"耐震"},{"w":"seismic","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with earthquakes","cn":"地震的","s":"Engineers added special ________ dampers to Taipei 101, so the tower moves less during strong winds and earthquakes.","zh":"工程師在台北101加裝了特殊的地震阻尼器，所以這座大樓在強風和地震時晃動得較少。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A94","t":"地震"},{"w":"building code","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the official rules about how buildings must be built","cn":"建築法規","s":"The new ______ ______ requires better insulation, so new homes will use less energy, although they may cost a little more.","zh":"新的建築法規要求更好的隔熱，所以新房屋會更節能，雖然價格可能會稍微高一點。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A95","t":"建築法規"},{"w":"structural engineer","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an expert who makes sure buildings are strong and safe","cn":"結構工程師","s":"After the earthquake, a ______ ______ checked every school building, and two of them were closed because of serious cracks.","zh":"地震過後，一位結構工程師檢查了每一棟校舍，而其中兩棟因為嚴重裂縫而被關閉。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A96","t":"結構工程師"},{"w":"surveyor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who measures land or checks the condition of buildings","cn":"測量師；房屋鑑定師","s":"Before buying the old house, we paid a ________ to inspect it, and he found that the roof needed urgent repairs.","zh":"在買下那棟老房子之前，我們花錢請了一位鑑定師來檢查，而他發現屋頂急需修繕。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A97","t":"鑑定師"},{"w":"steel frame","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a skeleton of steel beams that holds up a building","cn":"鋼構骨架","s":"The tower has a strong ______ ______, so the walls can be made of light glass instead of heavy stone.","zh":"這座大樓有堅固的鋼構骨架，所以牆面可以用輕巧的玻璃而不是沉重的石材來做。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A98","t":"鋼構骨架"},{"w":"waterproof","pos":"adj.","def":"not allowing water to go through","cn":"防水的","s":"We painted the roof with a ________ coating, so the ceiling no longer leaks when heavy rain falls in summer.","zh":"我們在屋頂上漆了一層防水塗料，所以夏天下大雨時天花板不再漏水了。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A99","t":"防水"},{"w":"fire-resistant","pos":"adj.","def":"not easily damaged or burned by fire","cn":"耐火的；防火的","s":"The doors in the hospital are made of ________ materials, so patients have more time to escape if a fire starts.","zh":"醫院的門是用防火材料做的，所以如果發生火災，病人會有更多時間逃生。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A100","t":"防火"},{"w":"embodied carbon","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the carbon released when making and transporting building materials","cn":"隱含碳（建材的碳排放）","s":"Steel and cement have high ______ ______, so architects now try to reuse old materials whenever they can.","zh":"鋼材和水泥有很高的隱含碳，所以建築師現在只要可以就會盡量重複使用舊材料。","part":"A","sec":"Construction Materials & Techniques 建材與營建技術","lab":"A101","t":"隱含碳"},{"w":"traffic","pos":"n.","def":"the cars, buses and other vehicles on a road","cn":"交通；車流","s":"The ________ is always heavy near the school at 7:30, so many parents now let their children take the MRT instead.","zh":"早上七點半學校附近的車流總是很多，所以許多家長現在讓孩子改搭捷運。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A102","t":"車流"},{"w":"traffic jam","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a long line of vehicles that cannot move or move slowly","cn":"塞車；交通堵塞","s":"We were stuck in a ______ ______ for two hours on the way to Yilan, so we missed the start of the concert.","zh":"我們在去宜蘭的路上塞車塞了兩個小時，所以錯過了音樂會的開場。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A103","t":"塞車"},{"w":"rush hour","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the busy time when most people travel to or from work","cn":"尖峰時段","s":"The trains are packed during ______ ______, so I leave home thirty minutes earlier to get a seat.","zh":"火車在尖峰時段擠滿了人，所以我提早三十分鐘出門好搶到座位。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A104","t":"尖峰時段"},{"w":"commute","pos":"v.","def":"to travel regularly between home and work or school","cn":"通勤","s":"My sister ________ from Taoyuan to Taipei every day, and she uses the long train ride to read novels.","zh":"我姊姊每天從桃園通勤到台北，而她利用漫長的火車車程閱讀小說。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A105","t":"通勤"},{"w":"pedestrian","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is walking in a street","cn":"行人","s":"Drivers must stop for every ________ at a crossing, but some still drive through without slowing down.","zh":"駕駛人必須在斑馬線前為每位行人停車，但有些人仍然沒有減速就開過去。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A106","t":"行人"},{"w":"cyclist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who rides a bicycle","cn":"騎單車的人","s":"The new path keeps every ________ away from the cars, so more students now ride their bikes to school.","zh":"新的車道讓每位騎單車的人遠離汽車，所以現在有更多學生騎腳踏車上學。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A107","t":"騎單車的人"},{"w":"bike lane","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a part of a road only for bicycles","cn":"自行車道","s":"The city painted a green ______ ______ along the main road, but delivery scooters often park on it, which is dangerous.","zh":"市政府沿著主要道路畫了一條綠色自行車道，但外送機車常常停在上面，這很危險。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A108","t":"自行車道"},{"w":"zebra crossing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"black and white stripes on a road where people can cross","cn":"斑馬線","s":"Always cross the street at a ______ ______, because drivers expect people there and are more likely to stop.","zh":"一定要走斑馬線過馬路，因為駕駛人預期那裡會有行人，所以更可能停車。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A109","t":"斑馬線"},{"w":"pavement","pos":"n.","def":"the path at the side of a road for people to walk on","cn":"人行道","s":"In many old streets, scooters are parked on the ________, so people with prams or wheelchairs have to walk in the road.","zh":"在許多老街上，機車停在人行道上，所以推嬰兒車或坐輪椅的人只好走在馬路上。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A110","t":"人行道"},{"w":"intersection","pos":"n.","def":"a place where two or more roads cross","cn":"十字路口；交叉口","s":"There are many accidents at this busy ________, so the police want to add more traffic cameras.","zh":"這個繁忙的十字路口發生過許多事故，所以警方想加裝更多交通攝影機。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A111","t":"十字路口"},{"w":"roundabout","pos":"n.","def":"a circular place where roads meet and cars drive around","cn":"圓環","s":"Drivers must give way to cars already on the ________, but many tourists are confused because they rarely use them at home.","zh":"駕駛人必須禮讓已經在圓環上的車輛，但許多觀光客很困惑，因為他們在家鄉很少用到圓環。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A112","t":"圓環"},{"w":"traffic light","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a set of red, yellow and green lights that control traffic","cn":"紅綠燈","s":"The ______ ______ near our school stays red for a long time, so students often wait in the hot sun.","zh":"我們學校附近的紅綠燈紅燈很久，所以學生們常常在大太陽下等待。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A113","t":"紅綠燈"},{"w":"speed bump","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a raised part across a road that makes cars slow down","cn":"減速丘","s":"The residents asked for a ______ ______ outside the kindergarten, because some drivers were going far too fast.","zh":"居民們要求在幼兒園外設置減速丘，因為有些駕駛人開得太快了。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A114","t":"減速丘"},{"w":"motorway","pos":"n.","def":"a wide fast road for travelling long distances","cn":"高速公路","s":"It takes about four hours to drive down the ________ to Kaohsiung, but the high-speed train takes only ninety minutes.","zh":"沿著高速公路開車到高雄大約要四小時，但搭高鐵只需要九十分鐘。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A115","t":"高速公路"},{"w":"ring road","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a road that goes around a city so traffic can avoid the centre","cn":"環狀道路；外環道","s":"Trucks now use the new ______ ______, so the old town centre is much quieter and the air is cleaner.","zh":"卡車現在改走新的環狀道路，所以舊市中心安靜多了，空氣也更乾淨。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A116","t":"環狀道路"},{"w":"flyover","pos":"n.","def":"a bridge that carries one road over another","cn":"高架橋；天橋","s":"The city removed the ugly concrete ________ above the old market, and the street below suddenly became bright and pleasant.","zh":"市政府拆除了舊市場上方醜陋的水泥高架橋，而下面的街道頓時變得明亮又宜人。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A117","t":"高架橋"},{"w":"underpass","pos":"n.","def":"a road or path that goes under another road","cn":"地下道","s":"Pedestrians can use the ________ to cross the busy road safely, although some people say it feels dark at night.","zh":"行人可以利用地下道安全地穿越繁忙的馬路，雖然有些人說它晚上感覺很陰暗。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A118","t":"地下道"},{"w":"metro","pos":"n.","def":"an underground train system in a city","cn":"地鐵；捷運","s":"Taipei's ________ is clean, cheap and fast, so many residents do not feel they need to own a car.","zh":"台北的捷運乾淨、便宜又快速，所以許多居民覺得自己不需要擁有汽車。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A119","t":"捷運"},{"w":"tram","pos":"n.","def":"an electric vehicle that runs on rails along city streets","cn":"路面電車","s":"The old ________ in Hong Kong is slow and noisy, but tourists love riding it because the tickets are cheap and the views are great.","zh":"香港的老電車又慢又吵，但觀光客喜歡搭乘，因為票價便宜而且風景很棒。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A120","t":"電車"},{"w":"light rail","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a modern electric train system that runs mainly on city streets","cn":"輕軌","s":"The new ______ ______ connects the station to the university, so students no longer need to wait for crowded buses.","zh":"新的輕軌連接車站和大學，所以學生們不再需要等擁擠的公車。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A121","t":"輕軌"},{"w":"bus lane","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a part of the road that only buses can use","cn":"公車專用道","s":"Buses are much faster since the city opened a ______ ______, but car drivers complain that the other lanes are now slower.","zh":"自從市政府開設公車專用道後，公車快多了，但汽車駕駛人抱怨其他車道現在變慢了。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A122","t":"公車專用道"},{"w":"park-and-ride","pos":"n.","def":"a system where you park outside a city and take a bus in","cn":"停車轉乘","s":"The ________ near the motorway is popular with commuters, because parking downtown is very expensive.","zh":"高速公路附近的停車轉乘很受通勤族歡迎，因為在市中心停車非常貴。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A123","t":"停車轉乘"},{"w":"car-sharing","pos":"n.","def":"a service where people rent cars for short periods","cn":"汽車共享","s":"________ is becoming popular among young people, because they can use a car when they need one without paying for parking.","zh":"汽車共享在年輕人之間越來越受歡迎，因為他們需要時就能用車，而且不必支付停車費。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A124","t":"汽車共享"},{"w":"carpool","pos":"v.","def":"to share a car journey with other people","cn":"共乘；共乘汽車","s":"Four teachers ________ to school every morning, so they save money on petrol and there are fewer cars on the road.","zh":"四位老師每天早上共乘一輛車到學校，所以他們省下了油錢，路上的車也更少。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A125","t":"共乘"},{"w":"ride-hailing","pos":"adj.","def":"booking a car and driver through a phone app","cn":"叫車（服務）的","s":"Many people use ________ apps late at night, because buses stop running and taxis can be hard to find.","zh":"許多人深夜時使用叫車應用程式，因為公車停駛，而且計程車可能很難叫到。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A126","t":"叫車"},{"w":"e-scooter","pos":"n.","def":"a small electric scooter that you stand on","cn":"電動滑板車","s":"Riding an ________ on the pavement is now banned in some cities, because several walkers were hurt in accidents.","zh":"在某些城市，在人行道上騎電動滑板車現在是被禁止的，因為有幾位行人在事故中受傷。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A127","t":"電動滑板車"},{"w":"parking space","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a place where one car can be parked","cn":"停車位","s":"It took us thirty minutes to find a ______ ______ near the night market, so next time we will take the bus.","zh":"我們花了三十分鐘才在夜市附近找到停車位，所以下次我們會搭公車。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A128","t":"停車位"},{"w":"parking meter","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a machine on a street that you pay to park a car","cn":"停車計時器；停車收費器","s":"My dad forgot to pay the ______ ______, so he got a ticket while we were eating lunch.","zh":"我爸忘了繳停車計時器的費用，所以我們在吃午餐時他就被開了罰單。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A129","t":"停車計時器"},{"w":"fare","pos":"n.","def":"the money you pay to travel on a bus, train or taxi","cn":"車資；票價","s":"The bus ________ is very cheap for students, so most of my classmates use public buses after school.","zh":"學生的公車票價很便宜，所以我大部分的同學放學後都搭公車。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A130","t":"票價"},{"w":"walkable","pos":"adj.","def":"safe and pleasant for walking around","cn":"適合步行的","s":"Kyoto is a very ________ city, because shops, temples and parks are close together and the streets are quiet.","zh":"京都是一座非常適合步行的城市，因為商店、寺廟和公園彼此距離很近，而且街道很安靜。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A131","t":"適合步行的"},{"w":"car-free","pos":"adj.","def":"where cars are not allowed","cn":"無車的；禁止汽車的","s":"The city holds a ________ day every September, and families ride bicycles on roads that are usually full of cars.","zh":"這座城市每年九月舉辦無車日，而家庭們在平常塞滿汽車的道路上騎腳踏車。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A132","t":"無車"},{"w":"gridlock","pos":"n.","def":"a situation where traffic cannot move at all","cn":"交通癱瘓；完全堵塞","s":"The parade caused ________ in the city centre, and some people left their cars and walked home instead.","zh":"遊行造成市中心交通完全癱瘓，而有些人乾脆把車丟下走路回家。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A133","t":"交通完全癱瘓"},{"w":"low-emission zone","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an area where old polluting vehicles must pay or cannot enter","cn":"低排放區","s":"London's ______ ______ charges old diesel cars a daily fee, so the air in the centre has become cleaner.","zh":"倫敦的低排放區向老舊柴油車收取每日費用，所以市中心的空氣變得更乾淨了。","part":"A","sec":"Transport & Getting Around 交通與移動","lab":"A134","t":"低排放區"},{"w":"green building","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a building designed to save energy and water and harm nature less","cn":"綠建築","s":"The new library is a ______ ______ with solar power and rain collection, so its electricity bills are very low.","zh":"新圖書館是一棟有太陽能發電和集雨系統的綠建築，所以它的電費非常低。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A135","t":"綠建築"},{"w":"passive house","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a very well-sealed home that needs almost no heating or cooling","cn":"被動式節能屋","s":"A ______ ______ keeps a steady temperature all year, so the family hardly ever turns on the heater or the air conditioner.","zh":"被動式節能屋一年四季都保持穩定的溫度，所以這家人幾乎從不開暖氣或冷氣。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A136","t":"被動式節能屋"},{"w":"net-zero","pos":"adj.","def":"producing as much clean energy as it uses, or no extra carbon","cn":"淨零（排放）的","s":"The company wants all its offices to be ________ by 2040, so it is putting solar panels on every roof.","zh":"這家公司希望在2040年前讓所有辦公室都達到淨零，所以正在每個屋頂裝設太陽能板。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A137","t":"淨零"},{"w":"thermostat","pos":"n.","def":"a device that controls the temperature of a room","cn":"恆溫器；溫控器","s":"We set the ________ to 26 degrees in summer, and our electricity bill dropped by almost twenty percent.","zh":"我們夏天把溫控器設定在26度，而我們的電費下降了將近百分之二十。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A138","t":"溫控器"},{"w":"photovoltaic","pos":"adj.","def":"changing sunlight directly into electricity","cn":"光電的；太陽光電的","s":"The school covered its sports hall with ________ panels, and now they produce enough power for all the classroom lights.","zh":"學校在體育館上鋪滿了光電板，而現在它們產生的電力足以供應所有教室的照明。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A139","t":"光電"},{"w":"heat pump","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a machine that moves heat from outside air or ground into a building","cn":"熱泵","s":"Our old water heater broke, so we bought a ______ ______, which uses much less electricity to make hot water.","zh":"我們的舊熱水器壞了，所以我們買了一台熱泵，它製造熱水所用的電少得多。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A140","t":"熱泵"},{"w":"double glazing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"windows with two layers of glass to keep heat and noise out","cn":"雙層玻璃窗","s":"Our flat is next to a busy road, but the ______ ______ keeps out most of the noise, so we can sleep well.","zh":"我們的公寓緊鄰一條繁忙的道路，但雙層玻璃窗擋住了大部分噪音，所以我們能睡得很好。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A141","t":"雙層玻璃窗"},{"w":"natural light","pos":"n.phr.","def":"light from the sun rather than from lamps","cn":"自然光","s":"The classrooms have large windows that let in plenty of ______ ______, so students feel more awake and focused.","zh":"教室有大窗戶讓大量自然光照進來，所以學生們感覺更清醒、更專注。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A142","t":"自然光"},{"w":"thermal mass","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the ability of heavy materials to store heat and release it slowly","cn":"蓄熱體；熱質量","s":"Thick stone walls have high ______ ______, so they absorb heat during the day and release it slowly at night.","zh":"厚實的石牆有很高的蓄熱能力，所以它們白天吸收熱量，晚上再慢慢釋放出來。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A143","t":"蓄熱能力"},{"w":"green wall","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a wall covered with living plants","cn":"綠牆；植生牆","s":"The hotel built a huge ______ ______ beside the entrance, and the plants help clean the air and cool the building.","zh":"那家飯店在入口旁建了一面巨大的植生牆，而這些植物有助於淨化空氣和替建築降溫。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A144","t":"植生牆"},{"w":"vertical garden","pos":"n.phr.","def":"plants grown up a wall or on shelves rather than on the ground","cn":"垂直花園","s":"Our flat has no yard, so we made a small ______ ______ on the balcony with herbs, lettuce and strawberries.","zh":"我們的公寓沒有院子，所以我們在陽台上用香草、萵苣和草莓做了一座小型垂直花園。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A145","t":"垂直花園"},{"w":"rain garden","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a low garden that collects rainwater from roofs and roads","cn":"雨水花園","s":"The school dug a ______ ______ near the car park, and now the playground no longer floods after heavy storms.","zh":"學校在停車場附近挖了一座雨水花園，而現在操場在暴雨後不再淹水了。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A146","t":"雨水花園"},{"w":"permeable surface","pos":"n.phr.","def":"ground covering that lets water soak through it","cn":"透水鋪面","s":"The new car park has a ______ ______, so rain can soak into the soil instead of running into the drains.","zh":"新停車場鋪設了透水鋪面，所以雨水能滲入土壤，而不是流進排水溝。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A147","t":"透水鋪面"},{"w":"greywater","pos":"n.","def":"used water from sinks and showers that can be used again","cn":"中水；灰水（可回收的生活廢水）","s":"The building collects ________ from its showers, and it uses this water to flush the toilets and water the garden.","zh":"這棟大樓收集淋浴產生的中水，並用這些水來沖馬桶和澆花園。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A148","t":"中水"},{"w":"sponge city","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a city designed to soak up and store rainwater like a sponge","cn":"海綿城市","s":"Wuhan is trying to become a ______ ______, so it has built wetlands and green roofs that hold water during storms.","zh":"武漢正努力成為一座海綿城市，所以它建造了濕地和綠屋頂，在暴雨時把水留住。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A149","t":"海綿城市"},{"w":"urban farming","pos":"n.phr.","def":"growing food and raising animals in a city","cn":"都市農業；都市農耕","s":"______ ______ is becoming popular in Taipei, because people want fresh vegetables and enjoy working with their neighbours.","zh":"都市農業在台北越來越受歡迎，因為人們想要新鮮的蔬菜，也喜歡和鄰居一起勞動。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A150","t":"都市農業"},{"w":"community garden","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a shared piece of land where local people grow plants together","cn":"社區花園","s":"Retired residents look after the ______ ______ every morning, and they share the tomatoes and beans with the whole street.","zh":"退休的居民每天早上照顧社區花園，而他們把番茄和豆子分享給整條街的人。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A151","t":"社區花園"},{"w":"street trees","pos":"n.phr.","def":"trees planted along the sides of roads","cn":"行道樹","s":"The ______ ______ on this road give shade in summer, so people prefer to walk here even though it takes longer.","zh":"這條路上的行道樹在夏天提供遮蔭，所以人們寧願走這裡，即使要花更多時間。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A152","t":"行道樹"},{"w":"pocket park","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a very small public park in a gap between buildings","cn":"口袋公園","s":"The empty lot between two shops became a ______ ______, and now office workers eat their lunch there under the trees.","zh":"兩家商店之間的空地變成了一座口袋公園，而現在上班族在那裡的樹下吃午餐。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A153","t":"口袋公園"},{"w":"biophilic design","pos":"n.phr.","def":"designing buildings that bring people closer to nature","cn":"親生物設計","s":"The hospital used ______ ______ with plants, water and wood, and patients said they felt calmer and recovered faster.","zh":"這家醫院採用了有植物、水和木材的親生物設計，而病人們說他們感覺更平靜，康復得也更快。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A154","t":"親生物設計"},{"w":"smart meter","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a device that shows how much energy you are using in real time","cn":"智慧電表","s":"After we installed a ______ ______, we saw how much power the old fridge used, so we finally replaced it.","zh":"我們裝了智慧電表之後，看到舊冰箱有多耗電，所以我們終於把它換掉了。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A155","t":"智慧電表"},{"w":"energy rating","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a label that shows how efficiently something uses energy","cn":"能源效率等級","s":"Before buying an air conditioner, check its ______ ______, because a better model can save you a lot of money over the years.","zh":"在買冷氣之前，先看看它的能源效率等級，因為比較好的機型多年下來可以幫你省下很多錢。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A156","t":"能源效率等級"},{"w":"zero-waste","pos":"adj.","def":"producing no rubbish that goes to landfill","cn":"零廢棄的","s":"The ________ shop sells rice and soap without plastic packaging, so customers bring their own jars and bags.","zh":"那家零廢棄商店販售沒有塑膠包裝的米和肥皂，所以顧客會自己帶罐子和袋子。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A157","t":"零廢棄"},{"w":"upcycle","pos":"v.","def":"to turn old things into something new and more useful","cn":"升級再造","s":"The students ________ old wooden pallets into benches for the school garden, and they won a prize for their design.","zh":"學生們把舊木棧板升級再造成學校花園的長椅，而他們的設計還得了獎。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A158","t":"升級再造"},{"w":"reclaimed wood","pos":"n.phr.","def":"old wood taken from buildings and used again","cn":"回收木材","s":"The café's tables are made from ______ ______ from an old train station, so each one has a unique colour and history.","zh":"這家咖啡店的桌子是用舊火車站的回收木材做的，所以每一張都有獨特的顏色和歷史。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A159","t":"回收木材"},{"w":"LED lighting","pos":"n.phr.","def":"lights that use small electronic bulbs and very little power","cn":"LED照明","s":"The city changed all its street lamps to ______ ______, and it now saves millions of dollars on electricity every year.","zh":"市政府把所有路燈都換成LED照明，而現在每年節省數百萬元的電費。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A160","t":"LED照明"},{"w":"district heating","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a system that sends hot water from one plant to heat many buildings","cn":"區域供熱","s":"In Copenhagen, most homes use ______ ______, and the heat often comes from burning rubbish that cannot be recycled.","zh":"在哥本哈根，大多數住家使用區域供熱，而熱能常常來自焚燒無法回收的垃圾。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A161","t":"區域供熱"},{"w":"urban forest","pos":"n.phr.","def":"all the trees growing in a city","cn":"都市森林","s":"Planting more trees will grow the city's ______ ______, which provides shade and helps birds and insects survive.","zh":"種植更多的樹會擴大城市的都市森林，它能提供遮蔭並幫助鳥類和昆蟲生存。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A162","t":"都市森林"},{"w":"cool roof","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a roof painted a light colour to reflect sunlight","cn":"涼屋頂；反射隔熱屋頂","s":"The factory turned its dark roof into a white ______ ______, and the temperature inside dropped by several degrees during the hot summer.","zh":"那間工廠把深色屋頂改成白色的涼屋頂，而炎熱的夏天裡室內溫度降了好幾度。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A163","t":"涼屋頂"},{"w":"overhang","pos":"n.","def":"a part of a roof that sticks out beyond the walls","cn":"屋簷；突出部分","s":"The wide roof ________ keeps the summer sun off the windows, but it lets in the low winter sun, so the house stays comfortable.","zh":"寬大的屋頂屋簷擋住了夏天照在窗上的陽光，但讓冬天低角度的陽光照進來，所以房子保持舒適。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A164","t":"屋簷"},{"w":"light pollution","pos":"n.phr.","def":"too much artificial light at night that hides the stars","cn":"光害","s":"Because of ______ ______, children in the city rarely see the Milky Way, so their teacher took them to the mountains.","zh":"因為光害，城市裡的孩子很少看到銀河，所以他們的老師帶他們到山上去。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A165","t":"光害"},{"w":"noise barrier","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a high wall beside a road that blocks traffic noise","cn":"隔音牆","s":"The government built a ______ ______ along the motorway, so people in nearby homes can finally open their windows.","zh":"政府沿著高速公路建了一道隔音牆，所以附近住家的人終於可以打開窗戶了。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A166","t":"隔音牆"},{"w":"air quality","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how clean or polluted the air is","cn":"空氣品質","s":"The ______ ______ is poor today, so the school has cancelled outdoor sports and students will play indoors.","zh":"今天的空氣品質很差，所以學校取消了戶外運動，學生們會在室內活動。","part":"A","sec":"Green & Sustainable Design 綠色永續設計","lab":"A167","t":"空氣品質"},{"w":"housing","pos":"n.","def":"buildings that people live in","cn":"住房；住宅","s":"________ in big cities has become so expensive that many young workers share flats with friends or live with their parents.","zh":"大城市的住房變得如此昂貴，以至於許多年輕上班族和朋友合租公寓或與父母同住。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A168","t":"住房"},{"w":"social housing","pos":"n.phr.","def":"homes provided by the government at a low rent","cn":"社會住宅","s":"The city is building more ______ ______ for young families, and the rent will be about thirty percent below market prices.","zh":"市政府正在為年輕家庭興建更多社會住宅，而租金將比市價低約百分之三十。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A169","t":"社會住宅"},{"w":"housing estate","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a large group of houses or flats built at the same time","cn":"住宅區；社區","s":"They grew up on a big ______ ______ with a playground in the middle, so they always had friends to play with after school.","zh":"他們在一個中央有遊樂場的大型住宅區長大，所以放學後總有朋友可以一起玩。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A170","t":"住宅區"},{"w":"apartment","pos":"n.","def":"a set of rooms for living in on one floor of a building","cn":"公寓","s":"Their ________ is on the tenth floor, so they have a great view, but they have to wait for the lift every morning.","zh":"他們的公寓在十樓，所以視野很棒，但他們每天早上都得等電梯。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A171","t":"公寓"},{"w":"studio flat","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small flat with one main room for living and sleeping","cn":"套房；單間公寓","s":"After graduating, I rented a tiny ______ ______ near my office, and although it was small, I loved having my own place.","zh":"畢業後，我在辦公室附近租了一間小小的套房，雖然它很小，但我很喜歡擁有自己的地方。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A172","t":"套房"},{"w":"condominium","pos":"n.","def":"a building of flats that are owned by the people living in them","cn":"（產權獨立的）公寓大廈","s":"Their ________ has a swimming pool and a gym, but the monthly management fee is quite high.","zh":"他們的公寓大廈有游泳池和健身房，但每月的管理費相當高。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A173","t":"公寓大廈"},{"w":"tenant","pos":"n.","def":"a person who pays rent to live in a place","cn":"房客；租戶","s":"The new ________ promised to keep the flat clean, so the landlord agreed to let her keep a small cat.","zh":"新房客承諾會保持公寓整潔，所以房東同意讓她養一隻小貓。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A174","t":"房客"},{"w":"rent","pos":"n.","def":"money paid regularly to live in a place you do not own","cn":"租金；房租","s":"The ________ in this area went up again this year, so many students are looking for rooms further from the university.","zh":"這一區的房租今年又上漲了，所以許多學生正在離大學更遠的地方找房間。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A175","t":"房租"},{"w":"lease","pos":"n.","def":"a legal agreement to rent a home or building for a period","cn":"租約","s":"We signed a two-year ________ for the shop, but we had to leave early because the owner sold the building.","zh":"我們簽了這間店面的兩年租約，但因為屋主賣掉了大樓，我們不得不提早搬走。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A176","t":"租約"},{"w":"mortgage","pos":"n.","def":"a loan from a bank to buy a home","cn":"房屋貸款；房貸","s":"My parents took out a twenty-year ________ to buy our house, and they will finally pay it all back next year.","zh":"我爸媽申請了二十年的房貸來買我們的房子，而他們明年終於要全部還清了。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A177","t":"房貸"},{"w":"homeowner","pos":"n.","def":"a person who owns the home they live in","cn":"屋主；房屋所有權人","s":"Every ________ in the building must agree before the old lift can be replaced, so the decision has taken two years.","zh":"大樓裡的每一位屋主都必須同意後才能更換舊電梯，所以這個決定已經拖了兩年。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A178","t":"屋主"},{"w":"housing market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the buying and selling of homes and their prices","cn":"房地產市場；房市","s":"The ______ ______ slowed down after interest rates rose, so some sellers had to lower their prices.","zh":"利率上升後房市放緩了，所以有些賣家不得不降價。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A179","t":"房市"},{"w":"resident","pos":"n.","def":"a person who lives in a particular place","cn":"居民；住戶","s":"Every ________ received a letter about the new recycling rules, but many people did not read it carefully.","zh":"每一位居民都收到了一封關於新回收規定的信，但許多人並沒有仔細閱讀。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A180","t":"居民"},{"w":"residential","pos":"adj.","def":"used for homes rather than offices or factories","cn":"住宅的","s":"Trucks are not allowed in this ________ area at night, because people complained that the noise kept them awake.","zh":"卡車晚上不准進入這個住宅區，因為人們抱怨噪音讓他們睡不著。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A181","t":"住宅"},{"w":"neighbour","pos":"n.","def":"a person who lives next to or near you","cn":"鄰居","s":"Our ________ looked after our dog while we were on holiday, so we brought her a box of pineapple cakes.","zh":"我們去度假時鄰居幫忙照顧我們的狗，所以我們帶了一盒鳳梨酥送她。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A182","t":"鄰居"},{"w":"convenience store","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small shop that is open long hours and sells everyday items","cn":"便利商店","s":"There is a ______ ______ on almost every corner in Taipei, so you can buy snacks or pay bills at any time of day.","zh":"台北幾乎每個街角都有便利商店，所以你在一天中任何時間都能買零食或繳帳單。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A183","t":"便利商店"},{"w":"street vendor","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a person who sells food or goods from a stall in the street","cn":"街頭攤販","s":"The ______ ______ outside our school sells hot sweet potatoes in winter, and students line up for them after class.","zh":"我們學校外面的街頭攤販冬天賣熱騰騰的烤地瓜，而學生們下課後排隊購買。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A184","t":"街頭攤販"},{"w":"night market","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an outdoor market that opens in the evening, selling food and goods","cn":"夜市","s":"We walked around the ______ ______ for two hours, and we tried stinky tofu, bubble tea and grilled squid.","zh":"我們在夜市逛了兩個小時，並且嘗了臭豆腐、珍珠奶茶和烤魷魚。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A185","t":"夜市"},{"w":"nightlife","pos":"n.","def":"entertainment such as bars and clubs that is open at night","cn":"夜生活","s":"The city is famous for its lively ________, so the streets are still busy at two o'clock in the morning.","zh":"這座城市以熱鬧的夜生活聞名，所以凌晨兩點街上仍然熱鬧。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A186","t":"夜生活"},{"w":"street lighting","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the lamps that light up roads at night","cn":"路燈照明","s":"Better ______ ______ has made the park safer at night, so more women now feel comfortable jogging there after work.","zh":"更好的路燈照明讓公園晚上更安全了，所以現在有更多女性下班後放心在那裡慢跑。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A187","t":"路燈照明"},{"w":"street art","pos":"n.phr.","def":"paintings and pictures made on walls in public places","cn":"街頭藝術","s":"The old alley is now covered in colourful ______ ______, and young people come from all over the city to take photos.","zh":"這條老巷子現在佈滿了色彩繽紛的街頭藝術，而年輕人從城市各地前來拍照。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A188","t":"街頭藝術"},{"w":"graffiti","pos":"n.","def":"words or pictures painted on walls without permission","cn":"塗鴉","s":"Someone sprayed ________ on the new bus shelter last night, so the city sent workers to clean it this morning.","zh":"昨晚有人在新的公車候車亭上噴了塗鴉，所以市政府今天早上派工人去清除。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A189","t":"塗鴉"},{"w":"vacant","pos":"adj.","def":"empty; not being used or lived in","cn":"空著的；閒置的","s":"There are many ________ flats in the old town, so the government wants to rent them cheaply to young artists.","zh":"舊城區有許多閒置的公寓，所以政府想把它們便宜地租給年輕藝術家。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A190","t":"閒置的"},{"w":"cramped","pos":"adj.","def":"too small for the people or things inside","cn":"狹窄的；擁擠的","s":"Five people live in the ________ flat, so the children have to do their homework at the kitchen table.","zh":"五個人住在那間狹窄的公寓裡，所以孩子們只好在廚房餐桌上寫功課。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A191","t":"狹窄的"},{"w":"spacious","pos":"adj.","def":"having a lot of space","cn":"寬敞的","s":"The new library is bright and ________, so students can always find a quiet corner even during exam week.","zh":"新圖書館明亮又寬敞，所以學生們即使在考試週也總能找到安靜的角落。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A192","t":"寬敞"},{"w":"evict","pos":"v.","def":"to force someone to leave their home by law","cn":"驅逐；（依法）逐出","s":"The landlord tried to ________ the family because they were late with the rent, but a lawyer helped them stay.","zh":"房東因為那家人遲繳房租而試圖驅逐他們，但一位律師幫助他們留了下來。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A193","t":"驅逐"},{"w":"squatter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who lives in an empty building without permission","cn":"違法佔住者","s":"A ________ had been living in the empty factory for months, and the police only found him when the building was sold.","zh":"一名違法佔住者已經在那間空工廠住了好幾個月，而警方直到大樓被賣掉時才發現他。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A194","t":"違法佔住者"},{"w":"shanty town","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an area of very poor homes made from cheap materials","cn":"貧民窟；棚戶區","s":"Many workers moved from the countryside to the ______ ______ on the edge of the city, because they could not afford proper homes.","zh":"許多工人從鄉下搬到城市邊緣的棚戶區，因為他們負擔不起像樣的住處。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A195","t":"棚戶區"},{"w":"quality of life","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how good and comfortable a person's life is","cn":"生活品質","s":"Moving to a smaller town improved their ______ ______ ______, because they spent less time in traffic and more time with their kids.","zh":"搬到較小的城鎮提升了他們的生活品質，因為他們花在塞車上的時間變少，陪孩子的時間變多。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A196","t":"生活品質"},{"w":"liveable","pos":"adj.","def":"pleasant and suitable for living in","cn":"宜居的；適合居住的","s":"Vienna is often named the most ________ city in the world, because it has clean air, good transport and plenty of parks.","zh":"維也納常被評為世界上最宜居的城市，因為它有乾淨的空氣、良好的交通和眾多公園。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A197","t":"宜居的"},{"w":"cost of living","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the money needed to pay for basic things like food and housing","cn":"生活費用；生活成本","s":"The ______ ______ ______ in big cities keeps rising, so many young people are moving to smaller towns to save money.","zh":"大城市的生活成本不斷上升，所以許多年輕人正搬到較小的城鎮以存錢。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A198","t":"生活成本"},{"w":"developer","pos":"n.","def":"a company that buys land and builds houses or offices on it","cn":"建商；開發商","s":"The ________ promised to build a park next to the new flats, but five years later the land is still empty.","zh":"建商承諾會在新公寓旁邊蓋一座公園，但五年後那塊地仍然是空的。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A199","t":"建商"},{"w":"noise complaint","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a report to the police or building managers about loud noise","cn":"噪音投訴","s":"Our neighbours made a ______ ______ about the party, so we turned the music down and apologised the next day.","zh":"我們的鄰居對派對提出了噪音投訴，所以我們把音樂關小聲，並在隔天道歉。","part":"A","sec":"Housing & City Life 住宅與城市生活","lab":"A200","t":"噪音投訴"},{"w":"acceptable","pos":"adj.","def":"good enough to be allowed or agreed to","cn":"可接受的","s":"Residents said the noise from the building site was ________ during the day, but they asked the workers to stop by six o'clock.","zh":"居民表示工地的噪音在白天是可以接受的，但他們要求工人在六點前停工。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"可以接受的"},{"w":"adjoining","pos":"adj.","def":"next to and joined to something","cn":"相鄰的；毗連的","s":"We booked two ________ rooms in the hotel, so the children could sleep next door while we stayed close by.","zh":"我們在飯店訂了兩間相鄰的房間，所以孩子們可以睡在隔壁，而我們也待在附近。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"相鄰的"},{"w":"assortment","pos":"n.","def":"a mixture of different kinds of things","cn":"各式各樣；什錦","s":"The market sells an ________ of handmade goods, so tourists can find gifts for everyone in their family.","zh":"這個市集販售各式各樣的手工商品，所以觀光客可以為家裡每個人找到禮物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"各式各樣"},{"w":"boundary","pos":"n.","def":"a line that marks the edge of an area","cn":"邊界；界線","s":"The river forms the ________ between the two cities, so people often argue about who should clean it.","zh":"這條河構成兩座城市之間的邊界，所以人們常常爭論應該由誰來清理它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"邊界"},{"w":"breadth","pos":"n.","def":"the distance from one side to the other; wide range","cn":"寬度；廣度","s":"The new bridge is impressive because of its ________, and four lanes of cars can cross it side by side.","zh":"這座新橋令人印象深刻是因為它的寬度，而四線車道的汽車可以並排通過。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"寬度"},{"w":"brittle","pos":"adj.","def":"hard but easily broken","cn":"易碎的；脆的","s":"Old plastic pipes become ________ in the sun, so they often crack when workers try to move them.","zh":"老舊的塑膠管在陽光下會變得易碎，所以工人試圖搬動時它們常常裂開。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"易碎"},{"w":"interconnected","pos":"adj.","def":"joined to each other so that each affects the others","cn":"相互連結的","s":"Housing, jobs and transport are closely ________, so a city cannot solve one problem while ignoring the others.","zh":"住房、就業和交通彼此緊密相互連結，所以一座城市不能只解決一個問題而忽略其他問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"相互連結"},{"w":"contiguous","pos":"adj.","def":"touching or next to each other along one side","cn":"相連的；鄰接的","s":"The park and the school are ________, so students can walk straight into the green area during their lunch break.","zh":"公園和學校是相連的，所以學生們午休時可以直接走進綠地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"相連的"},{"w":"default","pos":"n.","def":"what happens or is chosen if no other choice is made","cn":"預設（值）；預設選項","s":"Driving has become the ________ for many families in the suburbs, because buses come only once an hour.","zh":"對許多郊區家庭來說，開車已經成為預設選項，因為公車一小時才來一班。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"預設選項"},{"w":"fee","pos":"n.","def":"money you pay for a service or to enter a place","cn":"費用","s":"The museum charges a small entrance ________, but students can visit for free on Wednesday afternoons.","zh":"這座博物館收取少量的入場費用，但學生在星期三下午可以免費參觀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"費用"},{"w":"partnership","pos":"n.","def":"working together with another person or group","cn":"合作關係；夥伴關係","s":"The city formed a ________ with local companies, and together they built a new sports centre for young people.","zh":"市政府和當地企業建立了合作關係，而他們一起為年輕人建造了一座新運動中心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"合作關係"},{"w":"acquiesce","pos":"v.","def":"to agree to something without arguing, often unwillingly","cn":"默許；勉強同意","s":"At first the shop owners refused the plan, but they finally ________ when the council promised them more parking spaces.","zh":"起初店家們拒絕這項計畫，但當議會承諾給他們更多停車位時，他們最後勉強同意了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"勉強同意"},{"w":"timely","pos":"adj.","def":"happening at the right time","cn":"及時的；適時的","s":"Thanks to the ________ warning from the weather office, people moved their scooters before the street flooded.","zh":"多虧了氣象局及時的警告，人們在街道淹水前就把機車移走了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"及時的"},{"w":"swathe","pos":"n.","def":"a long wide area of land","cn":"一大片（土地）","s":"The new motorway cut through a large ________ of forest, so many animals lost their homes and environmental groups protested.","zh":"新高速公路穿越了一大片森林，所以許多動物失去家園，而環保團體提出抗議。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"一大片"},{"w":"appease","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone calmer by giving them what they want","cn":"安撫；平息（怒氣）","s":"To ________ angry residents, the company promised to plant trees and to stop work early every evening.","zh":"為了安撫憤怒的居民，該公司承諾種樹，並且每天傍晚提早收工。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"安撫"},{"w":"audacious","pos":"adj.","def":"very bold and willing to take risks","cn":"大膽的；有魄力的","s":"The architect's ________ design had a building that seemed to balance on one corner, and many people doubted it could be built.","zh":"那位建築師大膽的設計是一棟看似用一角保持平衡的建築，而許多人懷疑它能否蓋得出來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"大膽的"},{"w":"auspicious","pos":"adj.","def":"showing signs that something will be successful","cn":"吉利的；吉祥的","s":"Many families choose an ________ day to move into a new home, and they often check the calendar with their grandparents.","zh":"許多家庭會挑選一個吉利的日子搬進新家，而他們常常和祖父母一起翻黃曆確認。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"吉利的"},{"w":"blatant","pos":"adj.","def":"very obvious and done without shame","cn":"公然的；明目張膽的","s":"Parking in a bus lane is a ________ rule-breaking act, but some drivers still do it because fines are rarely given.","zh":"把車停在公車專用道上是公然的違規行為，但有些駕駛人仍然這麼做，因為很少被開罰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"公然的"},{"w":"buoyant","pos":"adj.","def":"successful and likely to stay strong (of an economy or market)","cn":"（經濟、市場）蓬勃的；看漲的","s":"The property market is still ________ in the city centre, but prices in the outer towns have started to fall.","zh":"市中心的房地產市場依然蓬勃，但外圍城鎮的房價已經開始下跌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"蓬勃"},{"w":"bustling","pos":"adj.","def":"full of busy, noisy activity","cn":"熙熙攘攘的；熱鬧的","s":"Dihua Street is ________ before Lunar New Year, and shoppers squeeze past each other to buy dried fruit and candy.","zh":"迪化街在農曆新年前熙熙攘攘，購物者擠來擠去購買果乾和糖果。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"熙熙攘攘"},{"w":"cacophony","pos":"n.","def":"a loud, unpleasant mixture of sounds","cn":"嘈雜聲；刺耳的雜音","s":"I woke up to a ________ of car horns, drills and barking dogs, so I closed the window and put on my headphones.","zh":"我被汽車喇叭、電鑽和狗吠的嘈雜聲吵醒，所以我關上窗戶並戴上耳機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"嘈雜聲"},{"w":"capricious","pos":"adj.","def":"changing suddenly without a clear reason","cn":"反覆無常的；多變的","s":"The weather in the mountains is ________, so hikers should bring a raincoat even when the morning looks sunny.","zh":"山上的天氣反覆無常，所以即使早上看起來晴朗，登山客也應該帶件雨衣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"反覆無常"},{"w":"chaotic","pos":"adj.","def":"in a complete mess and without order","cn":"混亂的","s":"The traffic was ________ after the power cut stopped the traffic lights, so police officers had to direct cars by hand.","zh":"停電使紅綠燈停擺之後交通一片混亂，所以警察只好用手指揮車輛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"混亂"},{"w":"clutter","pos":"n.","def":"many things lying around in an untidy way","cn":"雜亂的東西","s":"There was so much ________ in the small flat that we could hardly walk, so we gave away half of our old things.","zh":"那間小公寓裡有太多雜亂的東西，我們幾乎無法走動，所以我們把一半的舊東西送人了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"雜亂的東西"},{"w":"coalesce","pos":"v.","def":"to come together to form one group or thing","cn":"聯合；合併","s":"Several small villages slowly ________ into one large town as new roads and houses filled the gaps between them.","zh":"隨著新的道路和房屋填滿彼此之間的空隙，幾個小村莊逐漸合併成一個大城鎮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"合併"},{"w":"confluence","pos":"n.","def":"the place where two rivers join","cn":"（河流的）匯流處","s":"The old town was built at the ________ of two rivers, because boats could easily bring goods there from different areas.","zh":"這座古城建在兩條河的匯流處，因為船隻可以輕易地從不同地區把貨物運到那裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"匯流處"},{"w":"congregate","pos":"v.","def":"to gather together in a group","cn":"聚集","s":"Young people ________ in the square on Friday nights, and street dancers perform while their friends film them.","zh":"年輕人星期五晚上會聚集在廣場上，而街舞者表演時他們的朋友會幫忙錄影。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"聚集"},{"w":"untapped","pos":"adj.","def":"not yet used, although it could be useful","cn":"未開發的；未利用的","s":"Empty rooftops are an ________ resource in many cities, but they could be used for gardens or solar power.","zh":"空著的屋頂在許多城市是未被利用的資源，但它們可以用來做花園或太陽能發電。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"未被利用的"},{"w":"countless","pos":"adj.","def":"too many to be counted","cn":"無數的","s":"I have walked past that old building ________ times, but I never noticed the beautiful carvings above the door until today.","zh":"我已經走過那棟老建築無數次，但直到今天才注意到門上方美麗的雕刻。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"無數"},{"w":"decrepit","pos":"adj.","def":"old and in very bad condition","cn":"破舊的；老朽的","s":"The ________ apartment block had broken windows and no lift, so the elderly residents could hardly leave their homes.","zh":"那棟破舊的公寓大樓窗戶破損又沒有電梯，所以年長的住戶幾乎無法出門。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"破舊的"},{"w":"demarcate","pos":"v.","def":"to show clearly where an area begins and ends","cn":"劃定（界線）","s":"The city painted yellow lines to ________ the parking area, so drivers would stop blocking the fire exit.","zh":"市政府畫上黃線來劃定停車區，好讓駕駛人不再擋住消防通道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"劃定"},{"w":"derelict","pos":"adj.","def":"empty and falling apart because nobody uses it","cn":"廢棄的；荒廢的","s":"The ________ warehouse by the river was turned into a market, and now it is full of food stalls and live music.","zh":"河邊那間廢棄的倉庫被改造成市集，而現在那裡滿是小吃攤和現場音樂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"廢棄的"},{"w":"dismal","pos":"adj.","def":"sad, dark and without hope","cn":"陰鬱的；淒涼的","s":"The station looked ________ with its grey walls and broken lights, but after the makeover it became bright and welcoming.","zh":"這座車站以前有灰色牆壁和故障的燈，看起來很陰鬱，但改造後變得明亮又親切。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"陰鬱"},{"w":"enticing","pos":"adj.","def":"attractive and making you want to have or do something","cn":"誘人的；吸引人的","s":"The smell of fried chicken from the night market was so ________ that we stopped to buy some although we had just eaten.","zh":"夜市傳來的炸雞香味太誘人了，所以雖然我們剛吃過飯，還是停下來買了一些。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"誘人"},{"w":"expedient","pos":"adj.","def":"useful for a quick result, though perhaps not the best way","cn":"權宜的；方便的","s":"Building another road seemed ________ to the mayor, but experts warned that it would only bring more cars.","zh":"對市長來說，再蓋一條路似乎是權宜之計，但專家警告這只會帶來更多車輛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"權宜之計"},{"w":"fledgling","pos":"adj.","def":"new and still developing","cn":"剛起步的；初出茅廬的","s":"The ________ bike-sharing company had only fifty bikes at first, but now it has thousands across the city.","zh":"那家剛起步的共享單車公司起初只有五十輛腳踏車，但現在全市已有數千輛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"剛起步的"},{"w":"fraught","pos":"adj.","def":"full of problems or worry","cn":"充滿（問題、憂慮）的","s":"The plan to move the old market was ________ with difficulties, because the vendors did not want to lose their customers.","zh":"遷移舊市場的計畫充滿困難，因為攤販們不想失去他們的顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"充滿"},{"w":"generic","pos":"adj.","def":"not special; the same as many others","cn":"一般的；千篇一律的","s":"Many new shopping malls look ________, so travellers sometimes forget which city they are in.","zh":"許多新購物中心看起來千篇一律，所以旅客有時會忘記自己身在哪座城市。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"千篇一律"},{"w":"gradient","pos":"n.","def":"how steep a slope is","cn":"坡度","s":"The road to the school has a steep ________, so students on bicycles often have to get off and push.","zh":"通往學校的路坡度很陡，所以騎腳踏車的學生常常得下車用推的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"坡度"},{"w":"harmonious","pos":"adj.","def":"fitting together well in a pleasant way","cn":"和諧的；協調的","s":"The new museum has a ________ design that matches the old houses nearby, so it does not look out of place.","zh":"新博物館有著與附近老房子相配的和諧設計，所以它看起來並不突兀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"和諧"},{"w":"haven","pos":"n.","def":"a safe and peaceful place","cn":"避風港；安全的地方","s":"The tea garden is a quiet ________ in the busy city, and people go there to escape the noise for an hour.","zh":"那座茶園是繁忙城市中一個安靜的避風港，而人們會去那裡躲開噪音一個小時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"避風港"},{"w":"hub","pos":"n.","def":"the central or most important place for an activity","cn":"中心；樞紐","s":"Taipei Main Station is a transport ________ where the MRT, trains and buses meet, so it is crowded all day long.","zh":"台北車站是捷運、火車和公車交會的交通樞紐，所以它一整天都很擁擠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"樞紐"},{"w":"idyllic","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely peaceful and beautiful","cn":"田園詩般的；恬靜優美的","s":"The village looks ________ with its rice fields and mountains, but young people leave because there are few jobs.","zh":"這個村莊有稻田和群山，看起來恬靜優美，但年輕人紛紛離開，因為工作機會很少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"恬靜優美"},{"w":"immaculate","pos":"adj.","def":"perfectly clean and tidy","cn":"一塵不染的；完美無瑕的","s":"The streets in the old Japanese town were ________, although there were hardly any rubbish bins anywhere.","zh":"那座日本古鎮的街道一塵不染，雖然到處幾乎都沒有垃圾桶。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"一塵不染"},{"w":"omnipresent","pos":"adj.","def":"seeming to be everywhere at the same time","cn":"無所不在的","s":"Security cameras are ________ in modern cities, so people feel safer, but some worry about their privacy.","zh":"監視器在現代城市中無所不在，所以人們感覺更安全，但有些人擔心自己的隱私。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"無所不在"},{"w":"orderly","pos":"adj.","def":"well arranged or behaving in a calm, organised way","cn":"有秩序的；整齊的","s":"Passengers wait in an ________ line on the MRT platform, so getting on and off the train is quick and safe.","zh":"乘客在捷運月台上排成有秩序的隊伍，所以上下車既快速又安全。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"有秩序的"},{"w":"overarching","pos":"adj.","def":"most important and including everything else","cn":"首要的；總括的","s":"The ________ goal of the plan is to make the city greener, and every new project must help reach that goal.","zh":"這項計畫的首要目標是讓城市更綠化，而每一個新專案都必須有助於達成這個目標。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"首要"},{"w":"perimeter","pos":"n.","def":"the outer edge of an area","cn":"周邊；周界","s":"Workers put a fence around the ________ of the building site, so nobody could walk in by accident.","zh":"工人們在工地的周邊架起圍籬，好讓沒有人會不小心走進去。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"周邊"},{"w":"picturesque","pos":"adj.","def":"pretty enough to be in a painting","cn":"風景如畫的","s":"Jiufen is a ________ mountain town with narrow lanes and red lanterns, so it attracts thousands of visitors every weekend.","zh":"九份是一座有狹窄巷弄和紅燈籠、風景如畫的山城，所以每個週末都吸引數千名遊客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"風景如畫的"},{"w":"protracted","pos":"adj.","def":"lasting longer than expected or than usual","cn":"拖延的；曠日持久的","s":"After ________ talks that lasted three years, the owners finally agreed to rebuild the old apartment block.","zh":"經過持續三年、曠日持久的協商後，屋主們終於同意重建那棟老舊公寓大樓。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"曠日持久的"},{"w":"quaint","pos":"adj.","def":"attractive in an old-fashioned way","cn":"古色古香的；古雅的","s":"The ________ little bookshop has wooden shelves and an old cat, so many visitors stop there to take photos.","zh":"那家古色古香的小書店有木製書架和一隻老貓，所以許多遊客會在那裡停下來拍照。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"古色古香的"},{"w":"quell","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something such as fear, anger or protest","cn":"平息；消除","s":"The mayor held a public meeting to ________ fears about the new tower, and engineers explained how it would stay safe in earthquakes.","zh":"市長召開公聽會以平息大家對新大樓的擔憂，而工程師解釋了它在地震中如何保持安全。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"平息"},{"w":"radius","pos":"n.","def":"the distance from the centre of a circle to its edge; an area around a point","cn":"半徑；（某點周圍的）範圍","s":"There are three schools within a one-kilometre ________ of our home, so the children can all walk to class.","zh":"我家方圓一公里的範圍內就有三所學校，所以孩子們都可以走路上學。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"範圍"},{"w":"rebuff","pos":"v.","def":"to refuse an offer or request in an unfriendly way","cn":"斷然拒絕","s":"The owners ________ the developer's offer to buy their land, because they wanted to keep the family farm.","zh":"地主們斷然拒絕了建商買下他們土地的提議，因為他們想保留家族農場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"斷然拒絕"},{"w":"refurbish","pos":"v.","def":"to clean, repair and decorate a building again","cn":"重新裝修；翻新","s":"The hotel was closed for six months while workers ________ every room, and now it looks modern and bright.","zh":"飯店關閉了六個月，讓工人重新裝修每一間客房，而現在它看起來現代又明亮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"重新裝修"},{"w":"resonate","pos":"v.","def":"to seem important or meaningful to someone","cn":"引起共鳴","s":"The idea of a car-free street ________ with young people, so the online petition quickly got ten thousand signatures.","zh":"無車街道的構想在年輕人之間引起共鳴，所以網路連署很快就得到一萬個簽名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"引起共鳴"},{"w":"serene","pos":"adj.","def":"calm and peaceful","cn":"寧靜的；安詳的","s":"The lake in the park is ________ early in the morning, and old people practise tai chi beside the water.","zh":"公園裡的湖在清晨很寧靜，而老人家在水邊打太極拳。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"寧靜"},{"w":"sluggish","pos":"adj.","def":"moving or working more slowly than usual","cn":"緩慢的；不景氣的","s":"Sales in the old shopping area have been ________ this year, because many customers now prefer the new mall.","zh":"舊商圈的銷售今年一直很低迷，因為許多顧客現在偏好新的購物中心。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"低迷"},{"w":"solace","pos":"n.","def":"comfort when you are sad or worried","cn":"安慰；慰藉","s":"After moving to a big city alone, she found ________ in the small temple near her flat, where she could sit quietly.","zh":"獨自搬到大城市後，她在公寓附近的小廟找到了慰藉，在那裡她可以安靜地坐著。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"慰藉"},{"w":"staggering","pos":"adj.","def":"so large or surprising that it is hard to believe","cn":"驚人的","s":"The new stadium cost a ________ amount of money, so many taxpayers asked why the city did not build more homes instead.","zh":"新體育館花了驚人的金額，所以許多納稅人質問市政府為什麼不改蓋更多住宅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"驚人的"},{"w":"stark","pos":"adj.","def":"very clear and obvious, often unpleasantly so","cn":"鮮明的；明顯的","s":"There is a ________ contrast between the shiny towers downtown and the old houses nearby, so the city feels like two different worlds.","zh":"市中心閃亮的高樓和附近的老房子之間有著鮮明的對比，所以這座城市感覺像兩個不同的世界。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"鮮明的"},{"w":"stipulate","pos":"v.","def":"to say exactly what must be done, especially in a rule","cn":"規定；明文要求","s":"The new law ________ that every large building must have bicycle parking, so offices are now adding bike racks.","zh":"新法律規定每棟大型建築都必須設有自行車停車位，所以辦公大樓現在正加裝腳踏車架。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"規定"},{"w":"tranquil","pos":"adj.","def":"quiet and calm","cn":"寧靜的；平靜的","s":"We stayed in a ________ village by the sea, and the only sounds at night were the waves and the wind.","zh":"我們住在海邊一個寧靜的村莊，而夜晚唯一的聲音是海浪和風聲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"寧靜的"},{"w":"unsightly","pos":"adj.","def":"ugly and unpleasant to look at","cn":"難看的；不雅觀的","s":"The ________ electricity wires above the old street were moved underground, and now tourists can take better photos.","zh":"老街上方難看的電線被移到地下，而現在觀光客可以拍出更好的照片。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"難看的"},{"w":"untenable","pos":"adj.","def":"not able to be continued or defended","cn":"站不住腳的；難以維持的","s":"Paying half his salary in rent became ________, so my cousin moved back to his parents' home in the countryside.","zh":"把一半薪水拿去付房租變得難以維持，所以我表哥搬回鄉下父母的家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"難以維持"},{"w":"allay","pos":"v.","def":"to make fear or worry less strong","cn":"減輕（憂慮）；緩和","s":"The engineers tried to ________ the residents' worries, and they showed that the new tunnel would not damage nearby homes.","zh":"工程師們努力減輕居民的憂慮，並且證明新隧道不會損害附近的房屋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"減輕"},{"w":"appeal","pos":"v.","def":"to be attractive or interesting to someone","cn":"吸引；對……有吸引力","s":"Small cafés with plants and books ________ to young people, so many of them have opened in the old streets.","zh":"有植物和書本的小咖啡店吸引年輕人，所以許多這樣的店在老街上開張了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"吸引"},{"w":"approve","pos":"v.","def":"to officially agree to a plan","cn":"批准；核准","s":"The council finally ________ the plan for a new park, and the work will start after the rainy season.","zh":"議會終於批准了新公園的計畫，而工程將在雨季過後開始。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"批准"},{"w":"arbitrate","pos":"v.","def":"to help two sides who disagree reach a fair decision","cn":"仲裁；調解","s":"A lawyer was asked to ________ between the landlord and the tenants, because they could not agree on the repairs.","zh":"一位律師被請來在房東和房客之間仲裁，因為他們無法就修繕問題達成共識。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"仲裁"},{"w":"assuage","pos":"v.","def":"to make an unpleasant feeling less strong","cn":"緩和；平息","s":"The company offered free parking to ________ the anger of local shop owners, but many were still unhappy.","zh":"這家公司提供免費停車來緩和當地店家的怒氣，但許多人仍然不滿意。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"緩和"},{"w":"broaden","pos":"v.","def":"to make something wider or include more","cn":"拓寬；擴大","s":"The city plans to ________ the narrow road near the hospital, so ambulances can reach it more quickly.","zh":"市政府計畫拓寬醫院附近的狹窄道路，好讓救護車能更快抵達。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"拓寬"},{"w":"buttress","pos":"v.","def":"to support or make something stronger","cn":"支持；加強","s":"The mayor used new data to ________ her argument for more bike lanes, and the council finally agreed.","zh":"市長用新的數據來加強她增設自行車道的論點，而議會最後同意了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"加強"},{"w":"champion","pos":"v.","def":"to support and fight for a cause","cn":"擁護；倡導","s":"She has ________ public parks for many years, and thanks to her efforts, the city has planted over ten thousand trees.","zh":"她多年來一直倡導公共公園，而多虧她的努力，這座城市已經種了一萬多棵樹。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"倡導"},{"w":"constrict","pos":"v.","def":"to make something narrower or more limited","cn":"限制；使變窄","s":"The narrow streets ________ the flow of traffic, so buses in the old town are always slow at rush hour.","zh":"狹窄的街道限制了車流，所以舊城區的公車在尖峰時段總是很慢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"限制"},{"w":"contravene","pos":"v.","def":"to break a law or rule","cn":"違反（法規）","s":"The new hotel ________ the height rules for the old town, so the council ordered the owners to remove the top floor.","zh":"新飯店違反了舊城區的高度規定，所以議會命令業主拆除頂層。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"違反"},{"w":"counteract","pos":"v.","def":"to reduce the bad effect of something","cn":"抵消；對抗","s":"Planting trees can ________ the heat from roads and buildings, so the city is adding green spaces in every district.","zh":"種樹可以抵消道路和建築散發的熱，所以市政府正在每個區增設綠地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"抵消"},{"w":"dampen","pos":"v.","def":"to make a feeling or sound weaker","cn":"減弱；降低","s":"Heavy rain did not ________ the crowd's excitement, and thousands of people still came to see the new bridge open.","zh":"大雨並沒有減弱群眾的興奮之情，而仍有數千人前來觀看新橋通車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"減弱"},{"w":"deflect","pos":"v.","def":"to turn attention or criticism away","cn":"轉移（注意、批評）","s":"The mayor tried to ________ questions about the late subway line, but reporters kept asking him for a clear answer.","zh":"市長試圖轉移有關捷運線延宕的問題，但記者們不斷要他給出明確的答案。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"轉移"},{"w":"devolve","pos":"v.","def":"to pass power from a central government to a local one","cn":"下放（權力）","s":"The government decided to ________ more power to local councils, so each city can now make its own transport plans.","zh":"政府決定把更多權力下放給地方議會，所以每個城市現在可以制定自己的交通計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"下放"},{"w":"dilute","pos":"v.","def":"to make something weaker by adding something else","cn":"稀釋；削弱","s":"Critics say that adding too many shops will ________ the character of the historic street, and it will look like any other mall.","zh":"批評者說加入太多商店會削弱這條歷史街道的特色，而它會看起來和其他購物中心沒兩樣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"削弱"},{"w":"earmark","pos":"v.","def":"to set money aside for a particular purpose","cn":"指定（款項）用途；撥出","s":"The city has ________ two million dollars for new playgrounds, and the first one will open next spring.","zh":"市政府已經撥出兩百萬元用於新遊樂場，而第一座將在明年春天啟用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"撥出"},{"w":"forestall","pos":"v.","def":"to prevent something by acting first","cn":"預先阻止；搶先防止","s":"The council repaired the old bridge to ________ an accident, because engineers had found dangerous cracks under it.","zh":"議會修繕舊橋以預先防止意外發生，因為工程師在橋下發現了危險的裂縫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"預先防止"},{"w":"interweave / interwove / interwoven","pos":"v.","def":"to join closely together, like threads","cn":"交織；交錯","s":"In the old town, homes, shops and temples are closely ________, so daily life and religion are part of the same streets.","zh":"在舊城區裡，住家、商店和廟宇緊密交織在一起，所以日常生活和宗教存在於同樣的街道中。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"交織"},{"w":"lessen","pos":"v.","def":"to make something smaller or less","cn":"減少；減輕","s":"The new train line should ________ traffic on the motorway, but it will take a few years before drivers change their habits.","zh":"新的鐵路線應該能減輕高速公路上的車流，但駕駛人要改變習慣還需要幾年時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"減輕"},{"w":"materialise","pos":"v.","def":"to happen or appear as expected","cn":"實現；出現","s":"The promised shopping centre never ________, so the land beside the station is still empty after ten years.","zh":"承諾的購物中心從未實現，所以車站旁的土地十年後仍然是空的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"實現"},{"w":"outstrip","pos":"v.","def":"to become larger or faster than something else","cn":"超過；勝過","s":"Demand for housing has ________ supply in the city, so prices have risen and young couples struggle to buy a home.","zh":"這座城市的住房需求已超過供給，所以房價上漲，年輕夫婦很難買到房子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"超過"},{"w":"reinvigorate","pos":"v.","def":"to give new energy and strength to something","cn":"使重新振作；重新注入活力","s":"The weekend market helped ________ the quiet old street, and new cafés soon opened beside the stalls.","zh":"週末市集幫助這條寂靜的老街重新注入活力，而新的咖啡店很快就在攤位旁開張了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"重新注入活力"},{"w":"rescind","pos":"v.","def":"to officially cancel a law or decision","cn":"撤銷；廢除","s":"After thousands of people protested, the council ________ its decision to cut down the old trees on the avenue.","zh":"在數千人抗議之後，議會撤銷了砍伐林蔭大道上老樹的決定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"撤銷"},{"w":"shun","pos":"v.","def":"to avoid something or someone on purpose","cn":"避開；迴避","s":"Many young families ________ the city centre because flats are small and expensive, so they move to the suburbs instead.","zh":"許多年輕家庭避開市中心，因為公寓又小又貴，所以他們改搬到郊區。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"避開"},{"w":"solidify","pos":"v.","def":"to make something stronger or more certain","cn":"鞏固；使堅定","s":"The successful bike-sharing scheme helped ________ the city's reputation as a green leader, and other cities copied it.","zh":"成功的共享單車計畫幫助鞏固了這座城市作為綠色先鋒的名聲，而其他城市也紛紛仿效。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"鞏固"},{"w":"spearhead","pos":"v.","def":"to lead a campaign or activity","cn":"帶頭；率先推動","s":"A group of students ________ the campaign to save the old cinema, and they collected thousands of signatures in a week.","zh":"一群學生帶頭發起拯救老電影院的活動，並在一週內收集了數千個簽名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"帶頭"},{"w":"straddle","pos":"v.","def":"to cross or stretch across both sides of something","cn":"橫跨；跨越","s":"The new bridge ________ the river, and it connects two districts that were once separated by a long ferry ride.","zh":"新橋橫跨河面，而它連接了兩個過去需要搭很久渡輪才能往來的行政區。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"橫跨"},{"w":"subdivide","pos":"v.","def":"to divide something that is already divided into smaller parts","cn":"細分；再分割","s":"The landlord ________ the large flat into four tiny rooms, so he could earn more rent, but the rooms have no windows.","zh":"房東把大公寓再分割成四個小房間，以便賺更多房租，但那些房間都沒有窗戶。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"再分割"},{"w":"tout","pos":"v.","def":"to praise something to persuade people it is good","cn":"吹捧；大力宣傳","s":"The developer ________ the flats as luxury homes, yet buyers soon found that the walls were thin and the pipes leaked.","zh":"建商把這些公寓吹捧為豪宅，然而買家很快就發現牆壁很薄、水管還會漏水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"吹捧"},{"w":"unleash","pos":"v.","def":"to suddenly release a strong force","cn":"釋放；引發","s":"The new metro line could ________ a wave of building in the area, so land prices near the stations are already rising.","zh":"新捷運線可能會引發該地區的一波建設潮，所以車站附近的地價已經在上漲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"引發"},{"w":"vie","pos":"v.","def":"to compete strongly with others for something","cn":"競爭；角逐","s":"Several cities are ________ to host the international design fair, because it brings visitors and attention.","zh":"好幾個城市正在角逐國際設計展的主辦權，因為它能帶來遊客和關注。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"角逐"},{"w":"waive","pos":"v.","def":"to officially allow someone not to pay or follow a rule","cn":"免除；放棄（權利、費用）","s":"The museum ________ the entrance fee for local residents on Sundays, so many families visit at the weekend.","zh":"博物館在星期天免除當地居民的入場費，所以許多家庭在週末前往參觀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"免除"},{"w":"alluring","pos":"adj.","def":"attractive and exciting","cn":"誘人的；迷人的","s":"The idea of living by the sea is ________, but the wind and salty air can damage homes quickly.","zh":"住在海邊的想法很迷人，但海風和含鹽的空氣會很快損壞房屋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"迷人"},{"w":"bland","pos":"adj.","def":"without interesting features; dull","cn":"平淡無奇的；乏味的","s":"Many of the new office towers are ________ grey boxes, so architects want to add more colour and plants to the skyline.","zh":"許多新辦公大樓都是平淡無奇的灰色方盒，所以建築師們想為天際線增添更多色彩和植物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"平淡無奇的"},{"w":"commendable","pos":"adj.","def":"deserving praise","cn":"值得稱讚的","s":"The city's effort to plant trees on every street is ________, although some people say it should also fix the pavements.","zh":"市政府在每條街上種樹的努力是值得稱讚的，雖然有些人說也應該修好人行道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"值得稱讚的"},{"w":"congenial","pos":"adj.","def":"pleasant and friendly","cn":"宜人的；投緣的","s":"The café has a ________ atmosphere with soft music and friendly staff, so students often stay there for hours to study.","zh":"那家咖啡店有輕柔音樂和友善店員，氣氛宜人，所以學生們常常在那裡待上好幾個小時讀書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"宜人"},{"w":"conservative","pos":"adj.","def":"not willing to accept much change or new ideas","cn":"保守的","s":"The town's ________ planners rejected the glass tower, because they wanted all new buildings to look traditional.","zh":"這個城鎮保守的規劃者否決了那棟玻璃大樓，因為他們希望所有新建築看起來都很傳統。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"保守的"},{"w":"considerate","pos":"adj.","def":"thinking about other people's feelings and needs","cn":"體貼的；為他人著想的","s":"Our ________ neighbours always keep their music low after ten o'clock, so the whole building can sleep peacefully.","zh":"我們體貼的鄰居在十點後總是把音樂調小聲，所以整棟大樓都能安穩入睡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"體貼的"},{"w":"cosmopolitan","pos":"adj.","def":"full of people and ideas from many different countries","cn":"國際化的；多元文化的","s":"Singapore is a ________ city where you can hear many languages on the street, and you can eat food from all over the world.","zh":"新加坡是一座國際化的城市，你在街上能聽到許多種語言，而且能吃到來自世界各地的食物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"國際化的"},{"w":"decent","pos":"adj.","def":"good enough; of an acceptable standard","cn":"像樣的；過得去的","s":"Everyone deserves a ________ home with clean water and safe wiring, but many old buildings still lack these basics.","zh":"每個人都應該擁有一個有乾淨用水和安全線路的像樣住處，但許多老建築仍然缺乏這些基本條件。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"像樣"},{"w":"discreet","pos":"adj.","def":"careful not to attract attention","cn":"不顯眼的；低調的","s":"The solar panels are ________ and hidden behind the roof edge, so the historic house still looks the same from the street.","zh":"太陽能板很低調，藏在屋頂邊緣後面，所以這棟歷史建築從街上看起來仍然一樣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"低調"},{"w":"drab","pos":"adj.","def":"dull, grey and boring","cn":"單調乏味的；灰暗的","s":"The ________ concrete walls of the underpass were painted with bright murals, and now people actually enjoy walking through it.","zh":"地下道灰暗單調的水泥牆被畫上了明亮的壁畫，而現在人們真的很喜歡走過那裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"灰暗單調的"},{"w":"elegant","pos":"adj.","def":"graceful and attractive in style","cn":"優雅的；精緻的","s":"The old bank has an ________ marble entrance, so couples often go there to take their wedding photos.","zh":"那間老銀行有一個優雅的大理石入口，所以新人常常到那裡拍婚紗照。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"優雅的"},{"w":"grandiose","pos":"adj.","def":"too big or ambitious to be practical","cn":"浮誇的；過於宏大的","s":"The mayor's ________ plan for a floating city was never built, because it would have cost more than the entire city budget.","zh":"市長那個建造漂浮城市的浮誇計畫從未實現，因為它的花費會超過整個城市的預算。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"浮誇"},{"w":"lacklustre","pos":"adj.","def":"not exciting or impressive","cn":"平淡無奇的；缺乏活力的","s":"The new shopping street had a ________ opening, and fewer visitors came than the organisers had hoped.","zh":"這條新購物街的開幕平淡無奇，而來的遊客比主辦單位期望的還少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"平淡無奇"},{"w":"long-standing","pos":"adj.","def":"having existed for a long time","cn":"長期存在的；由來已久的","s":"Traffic jams are a ________ problem in this district, but the new metro line may finally solve them.","zh":"塞車是這個區長期存在的問題，但新捷運線或許終於能解決它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"長期存在的"},{"w":"lush","pos":"adj.","def":"covered with healthy green plants","cn":"茂盛的；蒼翠的","s":"The rooftop garden is ________ with ferns and vines, so it feels like a small forest above the busy street.","zh":"那座屋頂花園長滿了茂盛的蕨類和藤蔓，所以感覺像是繁忙街道上方的一座小森林。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"茂盛的"},{"w":"multicultural","pos":"adj.","def":"including people of many different cultures","cn":"多元文化的","s":"Our neighbourhood is very ________, and the summer festival includes food and music from Vietnam, Indonesia and the Philippines.","zh":"我們的社區非常多元文化，而夏季節慶包含來自越南、印尼和菲律賓的美食和音樂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"多元文化"},{"w":"nondescript","pos":"adj.","def":"very ordinary, with no interesting features","cn":"毫無特色的；平凡的","s":"The restaurant is inside a ________ grey building, but it serves the best beef noodles in the city, so there is always a queue.","zh":"那家餐廳位在一棟毫無特色的灰色建築裡，但它賣的是全市最好吃的牛肉麵，所以總是大排長龍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"毫無特色的"},{"w":"overpriced","pos":"adj.","def":"costing more than it is worth","cn":"定價過高的；太貴的","s":"Flats near the new station are ________, so many buyers are waiting for prices to fall before they decide.","zh":"新車站附近的公寓定價過高，所以許多買家在決定前正等著房價下跌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"定價過高"},{"w":"palatial","pos":"adj.","def":"large and beautiful like a palace","cn":"宮殿般的；富麗堂皇的","s":"The businessman lives in a ________ house with a pool and a garden, while his workers share small rooms in the city.","zh":"那位商人住在一棟有游泳池和花園的宮殿般的豪宅裡，而他的員工們卻在城裡合住小房間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"宮殿般的"},{"w":"panoramic","pos":"adj.","def":"showing a wide view of a whole area","cn":"全景的","s":"The tower's top floor offers a ________ view of the city, and on clear days visitors can see the mountains and the sea.","zh":"大樓頂層提供城市的全景視野，而在晴朗的日子遊客可以看到群山和大海。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"全景"},{"w":"ramshackle","pos":"adj.","def":"badly built and likely to fall down","cn":"搖搖欲墜的；破舊的","s":"The fishermen once lived in ________ wooden huts by the shore, but the government replaced them with safer concrete homes.","zh":"漁民們曾經住在海邊搖搖欲墜的木屋裡，但政府用更安全的水泥房屋取代了它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"搖搖欲墜的"},{"w":"run-down","pos":"adj.","def":"in bad condition because nobody has looked after it","cn":"破敗的；年久失修的","s":"The ________ shopping centre was almost empty, so the owners decided to turn it into flats and a library.","zh":"那座年久失修的購物中心幾乎空無一人，所以業主決定把它改建成公寓和圖書館。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"年久失修的"},{"w":"rustic","pos":"adj.","def":"simple and typical of the countryside","cn":"鄉村風格的；質樸的","s":"The guesthouse has a ________ style with stone walls and wooden beams, so guests feel far away from city life.","zh":"那間民宿有石牆和木樑的鄉村風格，所以客人感覺遠離了城市生活。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"鄉村"},{"w":"scenic","pos":"adj.","def":"having beautiful natural views","cn":"風景優美的","s":"We took the ________ route along the coast, and although it took longer, the ocean views were worth it.","zh":"我們走了沿著海岸、風景優美的路線，雖然花了更多時間，但海景很值得。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"風景優美的"},{"w":"secluded","pos":"adj.","def":"quiet and far from other people","cn":"僻靜的；隱蔽的","s":"The writer moved to a ________ cabin in the hills, because she needed peace and quiet to finish her book.","zh":"那位作家搬到山上一間僻靜的小屋，因為她需要安靜來完成她的書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"僻靜的"},{"w":"self-contained","pos":"adj.","def":"having everything needed inside, without sharing with others","cn":"設備齊全的；獨立的","s":"Each ________ unit has its own kitchen and bathroom, so students do not have to share with strangers.","zh":"每個設備齊全的獨立單位都有自己的廚房和浴室，所以學生們不必和陌生人共用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"設備齊全的獨立"},{"w":"spectacular","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely impressive and exciting to see","cn":"壯觀的","s":"The fireworks over Taipei 101 were ________ on New Year's Eve, and millions of people watched them on TV.","zh":"跨年夜台北101上空的煙火非常壯觀，而數百萬人在電視上觀看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"壯觀"},{"w":"sterile","pos":"adj.","def":"without life, warmth or character","cn":"缺乏生氣的；了無生趣的","s":"The new business park feels ________ at night, because there are no homes, shops or people after the offices close.","zh":"新的商業園區晚上感覺了無生氣，因為辦公室下班後那裡沒有住家、商店或人潮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"了無生氣"},{"w":"substandard","pos":"adj.","def":"below the normal or acceptable level","cn":"不合標準的","s":"Some cheap flats were built with ________ materials, so their walls cracked after only a few years.","zh":"有些廉價公寓是用不合標準的材料蓋的，所以它們的牆只過幾年就裂開了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"不合標準的"},{"w":"tasteful","pos":"adj.","def":"attractive and showing good judgement about style","cn":"雅致的；有品味的","s":"The hotel has a ________ lobby with simple wooden furniture, and guests say it feels calm and welcoming.","zh":"那家飯店有擺著簡單木製家具的雅致大廳，而客人們說那裡感覺平靜又親切。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"雅致"},{"w":"upmarket","pos":"adj.","def":"expensive and designed for rich customers","cn":"高檔的；高級的","s":"The old fish market became an ________ shopping area, but local fishermen say they can no longer afford to eat there.","zh":"舊魚市場變成了高檔的購物區，但當地漁民說他們再也吃不起那裡的東西了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"高檔的"},{"w":"well-off","pos":"adj.","def":"having plenty of money","cn":"富裕的；有錢的","s":"________ families often live near the best schools, so children from poorer areas may have fewer chances.","zh":"富裕的家庭往往住在最好的學校附近，所以來自較貧窮地區的孩子可能機會較少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"富裕的"},{"w":"ambience","pos":"n.","def":"the feeling or mood of a place","cn":"氣氛；環境氛圍","s":"The tea house has a peaceful ________ with soft lights and old music, so it is a perfect place for a quiet chat.","zh":"那間茶館有柔和燈光和老音樂，氛圍寧靜，所以是安靜聊天的完美地點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"氛圍"},{"w":"backdrop","pos":"n.","def":"the scenery behind something","cn":"背景","s":"The mountains provide a stunning ________ to the city, and photographers often climb nearby hills at sunset.","zh":"群山為這座城市提供了令人驚豔的背景，而攝影師們常常在日落時爬上附近的山丘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"背景"},{"w":"backlog","pos":"n.","def":"a large amount of work waiting to be done","cn":"積壓的工作；待辦的大量事項","s":"The city office has a huge ________ of building applications, so people may wait a year for planning permission.","zh":"市政府辦公室有大量積壓的建築申請案，所以人們可能要等一年才能拿到建築許可。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"積壓"},{"w":"blight","pos":"n.","def":"something that spoils or damages a place","cn":"禍害；破壞景觀的事物","s":"Empty shops and broken windows are a ________ on the old high street, so the council wants to attract new businesses.","zh":"空店面和破窗戶是這條老商店街的禍害，所以議會想吸引新的商家進駐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"禍害"},{"w":"clientele","pos":"n.","def":"all the customers of a shop or business","cn":"（全體）顧客；客群","s":"The café's ________ is mostly students and office workers, so it opens early and offers cheap breakfast sets.","zh":"這家咖啡店的客群主要是學生和上班族，所以它很早開門並提供便宜的早餐組合。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"客群"},{"w":"coalition","pos":"n.","def":"a group of people or organisations working together","cn":"聯盟；同盟","s":"A ________ of residents and environmental groups fought the new highway, and they finally persuaded the city to build a park instead.","zh":"一個由居民和環保團體組成的聯盟對抗新高速公路，而他們最後說服市政府改建一座公園。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"聯盟"},{"w":"cohort","pos":"n.","def":"a group of people of a similar age or in the same situation","cn":"（同年齡或同處境的）一群人","s":"This ________ of young workers is renting for longer than their parents did, because buying a flat has become so expensive.","zh":"這一群年輕上班族租屋的時間比他們的父母更長，因為買公寓已經變得非常昂貴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"群"},{"w":"constituency","pos":"n.","def":"the people who vote for a particular politician in an area","cn":"選區；選民","s":"The politician promised to improve buses in her ________, because many voters there do not own cars.","zh":"那位政治人物承諾改善她選區的公車服務，因為那裡許多選民沒有汽車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"選區"},{"w":"cross-section","pos":"n.","def":"a group that includes many different types of people","cn":"橫斷面；具代表性的一群人","s":"The survey asked a ________ of residents about the new park, so the results included young, old, rich and poor people.","zh":"這項調查訪問了具代表性的一群居民對新公園的看法，所以結果涵蓋了老少貧富各類人士。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"具代表性的一群"},{"w":"enclave","pos":"n.","def":"an area where a particular group of people lives","cn":"飛地；（特定族群的）聚居地","s":"The street became a small Indonesian ________, and you can now buy spices and newspapers from home in several shops.","zh":"那條街成了一個小小的印尼人聚居地，而現在你可以在幾家商店買到家鄉的香料和報紙。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"聚居地"},{"w":"epicentre","pos":"n.","def":"the central point of an activity or event","cn":"中心；震央","s":"The old district has become the ________ of the city's art scene, so galleries and studios have opened in empty warehouses.","zh":"老城區已成為這座城市藝術圈的中心，所以畫廊和工作室紛紛在空倉庫裡開張。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"中心"},{"w":"fixture","pos":"n.","def":"a person or thing that is always present in a place","cn":"固定存在的人或事物；常客","s":"The old noodle stand has been a ________ on this corner for fifty years, so locals were sad when it finally closed.","zh":"那個老麵攤五十年來一直固定在這個街角，所以當它最終歇業時，當地人都很難過。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"固定"},{"w":"footfall","pos":"n.","def":"the number of people who visit a shop or area","cn":"人流量；來客數","s":"________ in the shopping street rose after it was pedestrianised, and many shops reported higher sales.","zh":"那條購物街改為行人徒步區後人流量增加，而許多商店的銷售額也提高了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"人流量"},{"w":"forefront","pos":"n.","def":"the leading position in an area of activity","cn":"最前線；最前沿","s":"Copenhagen is at the ________ of green city design, so planners from around the world visit to learn from it.","zh":"哥本哈根處於綠色城市設計的最前沿，所以世界各地的規劃者都去那裡取經。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"最前沿"},{"w":"gateway","pos":"n.","def":"a place through which you enter a larger area","cn":"門戶；入口","s":"Keelung is the ________ to northern Taiwan for many cruise passengers, so the harbour area has been made more attractive.","zh":"對許多郵輪旅客來說，基隆是進入北台灣的門戶，所以港區已經被打造得更有吸引力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"門戶"},{"w":"inertia","pos":"n.","def":"a lack of desire to change or act","cn":"惰性；遲遲不動","s":"Because of political ________, the plan to fix the old bridge was delayed for years, and drivers grew angry.","zh":"由於政治上的惰性，修繕舊橋的計畫拖延了好幾年，而駕駛人越來越憤怒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"惰性"},{"w":"locality","pos":"n.","def":"a particular area or neighbourhood","cn":"地區；所在地","s":"The new hospital will serve the whole ________, so people will no longer need to travel to the city for treatment.","zh":"新醫院將服務整個地區，所以人們不再需要到市區就醫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"地區"},{"w":"mainstay","pos":"n.","def":"the most important part that everything depends on","cn":"支柱；主要依靠","s":"Tourism is the ________ of the town's economy, so the council spends a lot of money keeping the old streets beautiful.","zh":"觀光業是這個城鎮經濟的支柱，所以議會花很多錢維護老街的美觀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"支柱"},{"w":"makeover","pos":"n.","def":"changes that make something look much better","cn":"改造；大翻新","s":"The old train station got a complete ________, and now it has a café, a bookshop and a small art gallery.","zh":"舊火車站經過了徹底的改造，而現在那裡有一間咖啡店、一間書店和一間小藝廊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"改造"},{"w":"maze","pos":"n.","def":"a confusing network of paths or streets","cn":"迷宮","s":"The old town is a ________ of narrow lanes, so it is easy to get lost, but you may discover hidden temples.","zh":"老城區是由狹窄巷弄組成的迷宮，所以很容易迷路，但你可能會發現隱藏的廟宇。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"迷宮"},{"w":"nexus","pos":"n.","def":"a central connection point between several things","cn":"連結點；核心","s":"The station is the ________ of the city's bus, train and bike networks, so it is the busiest place in town.","zh":"這座車站是城市公車、火車和自行車網絡的連結核心，所以它是城裡最繁忙的地方。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"連結核心"},{"w":"outlier","pos":"n.","def":"a person or thing very different from the rest of the group","cn":"異常值；離群者","s":"Most cities in the survey had rising rents, but this town was an ________, because its prices actually fell.","zh":"調查中大多數城市的房租都在上漲，但這個城鎮是個異數，因為它的房價反而下跌了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"異數"},{"w":"panacea","pos":"n.","def":"something believed to solve all problems","cn":"萬靈丹","s":"Building more roads is not a ________ for traffic, because new roads often attract even more cars.","zh":"多蓋道路並不是解決交通問題的萬靈丹，因為新道路往往會吸引更多車輛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"萬靈丹"},{"w":"patchwork","pos":"n.","def":"something made of many different parts that do not match","cn":"拼湊物；大雜燴","s":"From the plane, the farmland looked like a ________ of green and yellow fields, while the city was a grey block.","zh":"從飛機上看，農地像是綠色和黃色田地的拼布，而城市則是一塊灰色的區塊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"拼布"},{"w":"precinct","pos":"n.","def":"an area of a town used for a special purpose, often closed to cars","cn":"（城市中的）特定區域；徒步區","s":"The shopping ________ is closed to traffic, so parents can let their children walk around freely.","zh":"這個購物徒步區禁止車輛通行，所以家長可以讓孩子自由地四處走動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"徒步區"},{"w":"tapestry","pos":"n.","def":"a rich mixture of different things","cn":"豐富多彩的組合","s":"The city is a ________ of old temples, modern towers and busy markets, so every street has something new to see.","zh":"這座城市是古老廟宇、現代高樓和熱鬧市場交織而成的多彩畫面，所以每條街都有新鮮事可看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"交織而成的多彩畫面"},{"w":"wasteland","pos":"n.","def":"an empty area of land that is not used or cared for","cn":"荒地；廢地","s":"The area behind the factory was a ________ for years, but volunteers cleaned it up and turned it into a garden.","zh":"工廠後面那塊地多年來是一片荒地，但志工們把它清理乾淨並改造成一座花園。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"荒地"},{"w":"aptly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a suitable or fitting way","cn":"恰當地；貼切地","s":"The street is ________ named Bamboo Lane, because tall bamboo grows along both sides of it.","zh":"這條街被貼切地命名為「竹巷」，因為兩旁長滿了高大的竹子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"貼切地"},{"w":"broadly","pos":"adv.","def":"in general, without considering details","cn":"大致上；整體而言","s":"Residents ________ support the new bike lanes, although some shop owners worry about losing parking spaces.","zh":"居民們大致上支持新的自行車道，雖然有些店家擔心會失去停車位。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"大致上"},{"w":"ever-increasing","pos":"adj.","def":"growing all the time","cn":"不斷增加的","s":"The city struggles to provide homes for its ________ population, so it is building new towns along the train lines.","zh":"這座城市難以為其不斷增加的人口提供住所，所以它正沿著鐵路線興建新市鎮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"不斷增加的"},{"w":"unparalleled","pos":"adj.","def":"better or greater than anything else","cn":"無與倫比的","s":"The tower offers ________ views of the harbour, so tickets for the observation deck sell out every weekend.","zh":"這座塔提供無與倫比的港口景觀，所以觀景台的門票每個週末都賣光。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"無與倫比的"},{"w":"throng","pos":"n.","def":"a large crowd of people","cn":"人群；群眾","s":"A ________ of shoppers filled the street on the first day of the sale, and the police had to control the crowd.","zh":"特賣第一天一大群購物者擠滿了街道，而警察不得不出面控制人潮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"群"},{"w":"abode","pos":"n.","def":"the place where someone lives (formal)","cn":"住所；居所","s":"Her tiny flat is a humble ________, but she has filled it with plants and books, so it feels warm and cosy.","zh":"她的小公寓是一個簡樸的住所，但她在裡面擺滿了植物和書，所以感覺溫暖又舒適。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"住所"},{"w":"boon","pos":"n.","def":"something very helpful","cn":"恩惠；福音","s":"The new metro line is a ________ for students in the suburbs, because their journey to school is now half as long.","zh":"新捷運線對郊區的學生來說是一大福音，因為他們的上學路程現在縮短了一半。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"福音"},{"w":"brisk","pos":"adj.","def":"quick and active","cn":"興旺的；輕快的","s":"Business at the night market was ________ during the holiday, so the vendors stayed open until two in the morning.","zh":"假期間夜市的生意很興旺，所以攤販們一直營業到凌晨兩點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"興旺"},{"w":"caveat","pos":"n.","def":"a warning that something is true only in certain conditions","cn":"但書；附加說明","s":"The plan sounds great, but there is one ________: it only works if enough people stop driving to work.","zh":"這個計畫聽起來很棒，但有一個但書：只有足夠多的人不再開車上班時它才行得通。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"但書"},{"w":"clamour","pos":"n.","def":"a loud demand or complaint from many people","cn":"強烈要求；喧嚷","s":"There has been a growing ________ for cheaper housing, so the government promised to build fifty thousand new homes.","zh":"要求更便宜住宅的呼聲越來越大，所以政府承諾興建五萬戶新住宅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"呼聲"},{"w":"clout","pos":"n.","def":"power and influence","cn":"影響力；權勢","s":"Large developers have a lot of political ________, so small community groups often find it hard to stop their projects.","zh":"大型建商有很大的政治影響力，所以小型社區團體常常很難阻止他們的開發案。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"影響力"},{"w":"coveted","pos":"adj.","def":"wanted very much by many people","cn":"令人垂涎的；眾所渴望的","s":"A flat with a river view is a ________ prize in this city, so prices for those homes are extremely high.","zh":"在這座城市裡，有河景的公寓是令人垂涎的寶物，所以那些房子的價格極高。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"令人垂涎的"},{"w":"crux","pos":"n.","def":"the most important point of a problem","cn":"關鍵；癥結","s":"The ________ of the problem is that there are not enough homes, so building more is the only real solution.","zh":"問題的癥結在於住房不足，所以興建更多住宅才是唯一真正的解決辦法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"癥結"},{"w":"culprit","pos":"n.","def":"the person or thing that causes a problem","cn":"罪魁禍首；元凶","s":"Experts say that air conditioners are the main ________ behind the city's summer power cuts, so they ask people to save energy.","zh":"專家表示冷氣是造成城市夏季停電的主要元凶，所以他們呼籲大家節約用電。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"元凶"},{"w":"debacle","pos":"n.","def":"a complete and embarrassing failure","cn":"徹底的失敗；大挫敗","s":"The new bus system was a ________ on its first day, because the apps crashed and passengers waited for hours.","zh":"新公車系統在第一天就徹底失敗，因為應用程式當機，乘客等了好幾個小時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"徹底失敗"},{"w":"deluge","pos":"n.","def":"a very large amount of rain or water; a huge amount of something","cn":"豪雨；洪水般大量湧來的事物","s":"The council received a ________ of complaints about the new parking fees, so it agreed to review them.","zh":"議會收到了排山倒海般的投訴，反對新的停車費，所以同意重新檢討。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"排山倒海般"},{"w":"detour","pos":"n.","def":"a longer route taken to avoid a problem","cn":"繞道；繞行路線","s":"The main road was closed for repairs, so the bus took a ________ through the back streets and we arrived late.","zh":"主要道路因施工封閉，所以公車繞道走後巷，而我們遲到了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"繞道"},{"w":"extravagant","pos":"adj.","def":"spending or costing far too much money","cn":"奢侈的；鋪張浪費的","s":"Critics called the golden bus shelters ________, and they said the money should have been spent on more buses.","zh":"批評者稱那些金色公車候車亭太奢侈，並說這筆錢應該用來增加公車班次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"奢侈"},{"w":"flaunt","pos":"v.","def":"to show something off proudly to get attention","cn":"炫耀；誇示","s":"Some rich residents ________ their sports cars on the narrow streets, but neighbours complain about the noise.","zh":"一些有錢的居民在狹窄的街道上炫耀他們的跑車，但鄰居們抱怨噪音很大。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"炫耀"},{"w":"fleeting","pos":"adj.","def":"lasting only a very short time","cn":"短暫的；稍縱即逝的","s":"We had a ________ view of the city lights from the train window before we entered the tunnel.","zh":"在進入隧道之前，我們從火車窗戶短暫地瞥見了城市燈火。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"短暫地"},{"w":"flimsy","pos":"adj.","def":"weak and easily broken","cn":"不牢固的；單薄的","s":"The ________ roof blew away in the typhoon, so the family had to stay with relatives until it was repaired.","zh":"那個不牢固的屋頂在颱風中被吹走了，所以這家人只好暫住親戚家直到修好為止。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"不牢固的"},{"w":"frenetic","pos":"adj.","def":"fast, busy and slightly out of control","cn":"狂亂的；忙亂的","s":"The ________ pace of city life makes some people tired, so they escape to the countryside at the weekend.","zh":"城市生活忙亂的步調讓一些人疲憊，所以他們週末會逃到鄉下去。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"忙亂的"},{"w":"glaring","pos":"adj.","def":"very obvious, usually about a mistake","cn":"明顯的；刺眼的","s":"There was a ________ mistake in the map, because it showed a bridge that had been knocked down years ago.","zh":"那張地圖上有一個明顯的錯誤，因為它標示了一座多年前就已拆除的橋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"明顯的"},{"w":"gruelling","pos":"adj.","def":"very difficult and tiring","cn":"累人的；艱辛的","s":"Construction workers face ________ hours in the summer heat, so the city now requires longer rest breaks at noon.","zh":"建築工人在夏日酷熱中面臨艱辛的工時，所以市政府現在規定中午要有更長的休息時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"艱辛的"},{"w":"impasse","pos":"n.","def":"a situation where no progress is possible","cn":"僵局","s":"Talks between the owners and the developer reached an ________, so the old building has stood empty for five years.","zh":"屋主和建商之間的協商陷入僵局，所以那棟老建築已經空置了五年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"僵局"},{"w":"infamous","pos":"adj.","def":"well known for something bad","cn":"惡名昭彰的","s":"The road is ________ for its traffic jams, so locals avoid it during rush hour and take the train instead.","zh":"這條路以塞車惡名昭彰，所以當地人在尖峰時段會避開它，改搭火車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"惡名昭彰"},{"w":"insidious","pos":"adj.","def":"harmful in a slow way that is hard to notice","cn":"潛伏的；暗中為害的","s":"Noise pollution is ________, because people slowly get used to it while it damages their sleep and health.","zh":"噪音污染是暗中為害的，因為人們會慢慢習慣它，而它同時在損害他們的睡眠和健康。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"暗中為害的"},{"w":"jarring","pos":"adj.","def":"shocking or unpleasant because it does not fit","cn":"突兀的；不協調的","s":"The bright pink hotel looks ________ next to the old temple, and many residents want the colour changed.","zh":"那家亮粉紅色的飯店在古廟旁邊看起來很突兀，而許多居民希望它換個顏色。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"突兀"},{"w":"leeway","pos":"n.","def":"freedom to decide or act as you want","cn":"迴旋餘地；自由空間","s":"The rules give architects some ________ in the design, but every building must still include a green roof.","zh":"這些規定在設計上給了建築師一些迴旋餘地，但每棟建築仍必須設置綠屋頂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"迴旋餘地"},{"w":"malaise","pos":"n.","def":"a general feeling that something is wrong or weak","cn":"萎靡不振；（社會、經濟的）低迷","s":"The town suffered an economic ________ after the factory closed, and many young people left to find work.","zh":"工廠關閉後這個小鎮陷入經濟低迷，而許多年輕人離開去找工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"低迷"},{"w":"menial","pos":"adj.","def":"boring, low-paid and needing little skill","cn":"卑微的；粗活的","s":"Many new arrivals in the city start with ________ jobs, but some later open their own shops and restaurants.","zh":"許多剛來到城市的人從低薪粗活的工作做起，但有些人後來開了自己的商店和餐廳。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"低薪粗活"},{"w":"meteoric","pos":"adj.","def":"happening very fast and with great success","cn":"迅速的；如流星般竄起的","s":"The town's ________ growth began when the science park opened, and its population doubled in ten years.","zh":"這個小鎮迅速的成長始於科學園區啟用，而它的人口在十年內翻了一倍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"迅速的"},{"w":"nuisance","pos":"n.","def":"something annoying that causes problems","cn":"討厭的事物；麻煩","s":"Loud motorbikes are a real ________ late at night, so the police have started to give fines to noisy riders.","zh":"深夜吵鬧的重型機車真的很惱人，所以警方已經開始對製造噪音的騎士開罰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"惱人"},{"w":"ominous","pos":"adj.","def":"suggesting that something bad will happen","cn":"不祥的；預示凶兆的","s":"Dark clouds gathered over the city in the afternoon, and the ________ sky warned us that a storm was coming.","zh":"下午烏雲聚集在城市上空，而不祥的天空警告我們暴風雨即將來臨。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"不祥的"},{"w":"outcry","pos":"n.","def":"a strong public protest","cn":"強烈抗議；公眾的憤怒","s":"The plan to cut down the old trees caused a public ________, so the city decided to move the road instead.","zh":"砍伐老樹的計畫引起公眾的強烈抗議，所以市政府決定改移道路。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"強烈抗議"},{"w":"paltry","pos":"adj.","def":"very small and not worth much","cn":"微不足道的；少得可憐的","s":"The tenants were offered a ________ sum to move out, so most of them refused and hired a lawyer.","zh":"房客們只被提供少得可憐的搬遷費，所以大多數人拒絕並請了律師。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"少得可憐的"},{"w":"perk","pos":"n.","def":"an extra benefit you get from a job or situation","cn":"額外的好處；福利","s":"One ________ of living downtown is that you can walk to concerts, but the downside is the high rent.","zh":"住在市中心的一個好處是可以走路去聽音樂會，但缺點是房租很高。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"好處"},{"w":"pretext","pos":"n.","def":"a false reason given to hide the real one","cn":"藉口；托辭","s":"The landlord used repairs as a ________ to remove the tenants, but he really wanted to rent the flat for more money.","zh":"房東以修繕為藉口趕走房客，但他真正想要的是把公寓以更高價出租。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"藉口"},{"w":"quandary","pos":"n.","def":"a situation where it is hard to decide what to do","cn":"困惑；左右為難","s":"The family was in a ________: they could buy a big house far away or rent a small flat near work.","zh":"這家人陷入兩難：他們可以在遠處買一棟大房子，或者在工作地點附近租一間小公寓。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"兩難"},{"w":"ravage","pos":"v.","def":"to damage something very badly","cn":"摧毀；嚴重破壞","s":"Floods ________ the low-lying parts of the city last summer, so engineers are now building higher river walls.","zh":"去年夏天洪水嚴重破壞了這座城市的低窪地區，所以工程師現在正在興建更高的河堤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"嚴重破壞"},{"w":"recourse","pos":"n.","def":"a possible way to get help in a difficult situation","cn":"求助的途徑；依靠","s":"Tenants who are treated unfairly have little ________ in some countries, because the laws mainly protect landlords.","zh":"在某些國家，受到不公平對待的房客幾乎沒有求助的途徑，因為法律主要保護房東。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"求助的途徑"},{"w":"reprieve","pos":"n.","def":"a delay or cancellation of something bad","cn":"暫緩；緩刑","s":"The old cinema got a ________ when a rich fan offered to pay its rent, so it will stay open for another year.","zh":"當一位富有的影迷提議替它付租金時，這間老電影院獲得了暫緩關閉的機會，所以它將再營業一年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"暫緩關閉"},{"w":"rife","pos":"adj.","def":"very common, usually about something bad","cn":"（壞事）盛行的；普遍的","s":"Illegal parking is ________ in the old district, so the police are using cameras to catch drivers.","zh":"違規停車在舊城區很普遍，所以警方正在用攝影機抓違規駕駛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"普遍"},{"w":"scant","pos":"adj.","def":"very little; not enough","cn":"不足的；極少的","s":"The developer paid ________ attention to the residents' concerns, and as a result, the project faced months of protests.","zh":"建商對居民的擔憂幾乎不重視，結果這項計畫遭遇了好幾個月的抗議。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"幾乎不"},{"w":"concrete jungle","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a city with many big grey buildings and few green areas","cn":"水泥叢林","s":"After living in the ______ ______ for ten years, my uncle moved to a farm, because he missed trees and fresh air.","zh":"在水泥叢林裡住了十年後，我叔叔搬到一座農場，因為他想念樹木和新鮮空氣。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"水泥叢林"},{"w":"on the doorstep","pos":"phr.","def":"very near to where you live","cn":"就在家門口；近在咫尺","s":"We have a great night market right ______ ______ ______, so we often go there for dinner after work.","zh":"我們家門口就有一個很棒的夜市，所以我們下班後常去那裡吃晚餐。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"家門口"},{"w":"within walking distance of","pos":"phr.","def":"close enough to walk to","cn":"在步行可到的距離內","s":"Our new flat is ______ ______ ______ ______ the MRT station, so I no longer need to ride my scooter to work.","zh":"我們的新公寓離捷運站走路就到，所以我不再需要騎機車去上班。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"離 走路就到"},{"w":"hustle and bustle","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the noise and busy activity of a crowded place","cn":"熙來攘往；喧囂忙碌","s":"Some people love the ______ ______ ______ of Taipei, but my grandparents prefer the quiet life in their village.","zh":"有些人喜歡台北的熙來攘往，但我的祖父母比較喜歡他們村子裡的寧靜生活。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"熙來攘往"},{"w":"bricks and mortar","pos":"n.phr.","def":"real buildings, especially shops, rather than online businesses","cn":"實體店面；實體建築","s":"Many shops are closing their ______ ______ ______ stores, because more customers now buy clothes online.","zh":"許多商店正在關閉它們的實體店面，因為現在有更多顧客在網路上買衣服。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"實體"},{"w":"off the beaten track","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"far away from places that many people visit","cn":"人跡罕至的；偏僻的","s":"The little café is ______ ______ ______ ______, but people who find it say it serves the best coffee in town.","zh":"那家小咖啡店位置偏僻，但找到它的人都說那裡的咖啡是鎮上最好喝的。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"偏僻"},{"w":"in the heart of","pos":"phr.","def":"in the centre of a place","cn":"在……的中心","s":"The hotel is ______ ______ ______ ______ the old town, so guests can walk to the temples and markets in minutes.","zh":"這家飯店位於舊城區的中心，所以客人幾分鐘內就能走到廟宇和市場。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"中心"},{"w":"built-up area","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a place with many buildings and few open spaces","cn":"建成區；房屋密集區","s":"Drivers must slow down in a ______ ______, because children and old people may suddenly cross the road.","zh":"駕駛人在房屋密集區必須減速，因為小孩和老人可能會突然穿越馬路。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"房屋密集區"},{"w":"tear down","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to destroy a building completely (tear / tore / torn)","cn":"拆除；拆毀","s":"The company wanted to ______ ______ the old theatre, but local people protested, so it was saved and repaired.","zh":"那家公司想拆除老劇院，但當地人提出抗議，所以它被保留並修復了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"拆除"},{"w":"make way for","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to be removed so that something new can replace it","cn":"讓路給；為……騰出空間","s":"The old houses were knocked down to ______ ______ ______ a new park, and now children play where the buildings once stood.","zh":"那些老房子被拆除以騰出空間給一座新公園，而現在孩子們在原本建築物所在的地方玩耍。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"騰出空間給"},{"w":"a breath of fresh air","pos":"n.phr.","def":"something new and different that is very welcome","cn":"令人耳目一新的人或事物","s":"The young architect's colourful design was ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, because most buildings in the town were plain and grey.","zh":"那位年輕建築師色彩繽紛的設計令人耳目一新，因為這個城鎮大部分的建築都樸素又灰暗。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"令人耳目一新"},{"w":"bumper-to-bumper","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"with vehicles so close together that they can hardly move","cn":"車輛一輛接一輛的；大塞車的","s":"The traffic was ________ on the way to the beach, so we turned around and went to a park nearer home.","zh":"往海邊的路上車子一輛接一輛大塞車，所以我們掉頭去了離家較近的公園。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"車子一輛接一輛大塞車"},{"w":"green space","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an area of grass, trees or plants in a town","cn":"綠地；綠色空間","s":"Every child needs some ______ ______ to run and play in, so the city is turning car parks into small parks.","zh":"每個孩子都需要一些可以奔跑玩耍的綠地，所以市政府正把停車場改建成小公園。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"綠地"},{"w":"not in my back yard","pos":"phr.","def":"said by people who support a project but not near their home (NIMBY)","cn":"別蓋在我家後院（鄰避心態）","s":"Everyone agrees the city needs a new rubbish plant, but residents keep saying \"______ ______ ______ ______ ______\" whenever a site is chosen.","zh":"每個人都同意城市需要新的垃圾處理廠，但每當選定地點時，居民們總是說「別蓋在我家後院」。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"別蓋在我家後院"},{"w":"get on the property ladder","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to buy your first home (get / got / got)","cn":"買下第一間房子；踏入房市","s":"Young couples find it hard to ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, because prices have risen much faster than salaries.","zh":"年輕夫婦發現很難買下第一間房子，因為房價上漲的速度遠比薪水快。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"買下第一間房子"},{"w":"rent out","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to let someone use your property in return for money","cn":"出租","s":"My aunt decided to ______ ______ her spare room to a university student, and the extra money helps pay her bills.","zh":"我阿姨決定把她的空房間出租給一位大學生，而這筆額外的收入幫她支付帳單。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"出租"},{"w":"a far cry from","pos":"n.phr.","def":"very different from","cn":"與……大不相同；相差甚遠","s":"Today's busy harbour is ______ ______ ______ ______ the small fishing village it was a hundred years ago, but some old houses remain.","zh":"今天繁忙的港口與一百年前那個小漁村大不相同，但仍有一些老房子保留了下來。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"與 大不相同"},{"w":"live off the grid","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to live without public electricity or water supplies","cn":"過著不依賴公共電網的生活","s":"The family decided to ______ ______ ______ ______ in the mountains, so they use solar panels and collect rainwater.","zh":"這家人決定在山上過著不依賴公共電網的生活，所以他們使用太陽能板並收集雨水。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"過著不依賴公共電網的生活"},{"w":"a sense of belonging","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the feeling of being accepted as part of a group or place","cn":"歸屬感","s":"Joining the community garden gave the new residents ______ ______ ______ ______, and they quickly made friends with their neighbours.","zh":"加入社區花園讓新住戶有了歸屬感，而且他們很快就和鄰居成為朋友。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"歸屬感"},{"w":"stuck in traffic","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"unable to move because the roads are full of vehicles","cn":"塞在車陣中","s":"I was ______ ______ ______ for an hour this morning, so I missed the first part of the meeting.","zh":"我今天早上塞在車陣中一個小時，所以錯過了會議的第一部分。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"塞在車陣中"}]};
